00:20:32,810 --> 00:20:33,410
No, Link!

287
00:20:33,570 --> 00:20:33,830
Link!

288
00:20:36,550 --> 00:20:37,510
14.41.

289
00:20:38,730 --> 00:20:40,630
So, is time flowing?

290
00:20:41,330 --> 00:20:42,070
Is it going?

291
00:20:49,020 --> 00:20:50,300
Is it still 14.41?

292
00:20:50,900 --> 00:20:51,780
Ooh, okay, okay.

293
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:55,040
Uh, Link, can you please stop?

294
00:20:55,220 --> 00:20:55,560
Okay, thanks.

295
00:20:57,020 --> 00:20:57,400
Up.

296
00:20:58,280 --> 00:20:59,340
Maybe you should drink this milk.

297
00:20:59,740 --> 00:21:00,400
Do I still have milk?

298
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:02,540
I don't, but I have this down here.

299
00:21:03,340 --> 00:21:04,260
I'm gonna save it.

300
00:21:07,560 --> 00:21:08,000
Ooh.

301
00:21:09,260 --> 00:21:09,700
Hello.

302
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:14,420
You've done well to come all the way up here, Link.

303
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:17,960
This is the summit of the Sacred Death Mountain.

304
00:21:18,280 --> 00:21:18,540
What?

305
00:21:19,700 --> 00:21:24,440
It is said that the clouds surrounding this peak reflect the condition of Death Mountain.

306
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:27,600
When they look normal, it is at peace.

307
00:21:29,240 --> 00:21:32,020
Climbing all the way up here just proves how smart you are.

308
00:21:32,560 --> 00:21:34,060
Now I want you to see...

309
00:21:34,060 --> 00:21:36,220
I want to see you make another smart move.

310
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:37,420
Okay, okay, okay.

311
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:41,820
The great fairy lives on this mountaintop, and she will give you a new skill.

312
00:21:42,660 --> 00:21:44,220
She's the leader of the fairies, you know.

313
00:21:44,380 --> 00:21:44,560
Ooh!

314
00:21:45,500 --> 00:21:45,900
Okay.

315
00:21:46,360 --> 00:21:47,920
I will perch here and wait for you.

316
00:21:48,340 --> 00:21:50,700
When you're ready to go back down, I can help you.

317
00:21:50,700 --> 00:21:51,920
Now, get going!

318
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:54,460
So bossy!

319
00:21:56,360 --> 00:21:57,380
My goodness.

320
00:21:58,560 --> 00:21:59,620
No money in that?

321
00:21:59,860 --> 00:22:00,920
Can I break this?

322
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:01,900
What's going on here?

323
00:22:04,420 --> 00:22:05,400
Question marks.

324
00:22:11,410 --> 00:22:12,070
Aha!

325
00:22:12,650 --> 00:22:15,230
That reminds me, there's another path down below.

326
00:22:17,190 --> 00:22:19,190
Bro, what is that sound?

327
00:22:23,070 --> 00:22:24,510
I could be a voice actor.

328
00:22:27,530 --> 00:22:28,190
Great...

329
00:22:28,190 --> 00:22:29,510
Oh, great fairy's mountain.

330
00:22:31,450 --> 00:22:33,250
Oh, I thought I had to go all the way up on top.

331
00:22:33,390 --> 00:22:33,590
Okay.

332
00:22:34,490 --> 00:22:34,750
Whoa.

333
00:22:39,020 --> 00:22:40,400
That just lit everything up.

334
00:22:48,670 --> 00:22:49,110
Uh...

335
00:22:49,650 --> 00:22:50,090
Check.

336
00:22:50,350 --> 00:22:50,750
Oh!

337
00:22:51,610 --> 00:22:54,710
The crest of the royal family of Hyrule is inscribed here.

338
00:22:59,480 --> 00:22:59,920
Okay.

339
00:23:09,520 --> 00:23:11,580
Uh, I think I may have misunderstood something here.

340
00:23:11,780 --> 00:23:12,420
Let's go back out.

341
00:23:18,980 --> 00:23:19,420
Uh...

342
00:23:19,420 --> 00:23:20,140
Mr. Owl?

343
00:23:23,330 --> 00:23:23,910
Okay, okay.

344
00:23:23,990 --> 00:23:24,890
It's gonna be the same, isn't it?

345
00:23:26,650 --> 00:23:27,570
You don't have to...

346
00:23:27,570 --> 00:23:28,490
Why can't I skip through this?

347
00:23:31,050 --> 00:23:32,250
I can't even see your face.

348
00:23:32,350 --> 00:23:32,550
Oh, wait.

349
00:23:32,570 --> 00:23:33,150
It's upside down.

350
00:23:33,610 --> 00:23:34,570
You're doing that weird thing again.

351
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:38,820
How small your eyes are!

352
00:23:43,260 --> 00:23:43,740
Come on!

353
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:47,160
Ah, crap.

354
00:23:51,740 --> 00:23:52,100
Okay.

355
00:23:52,340 --> 00:23:53,060
Uh, what was this?

356
00:23:56,080 --> 00:23:56,440
Yo.

357
00:23:58,460 --> 00:23:59,520
Wait a second.

358
00:24:03,570 --> 00:24:04,010
Oh.

359
00:24:04,250 --> 00:24:05,650
Death Mountain Crater.

360
00:24:08,530 --> 00:24:09,910
Link, it's so hot in here!

361
00:24:09,990 --> 00:24:10,890
We can't stay here for long.

362
00:24:11,890 --> 00:24:12,330
Oh!

363
00:24:20,020 --> 00:24:20,620
Oh no!

364
00:24:20,840 --> 00:24:21,320
Okay, yeah.

365
00:24:21,640 --> 00:24:22,260
We're leaving.

366
00:24:23,820 --> 00:24:24,260
Nope.

367
00:24:27,120 --> 00:24:28,620
Yeah, definitely not doing that.

368
00:24:29,080 --> 00:24:30,500
Uh, I'm gonna go back in here.

369
00:24:32,940 --> 00:24:35,160
Okay, so I think we gotta get a skill in here somehow.

370
00:24:35,580 --> 00:24:37,280
And that will give us, uh, what we need.

371
00:24:37,800 --> 00:24:38,840
To survive the fire.

372
00:24:43,130 --> 00:24:43,690
Oh, oh!

373
00:24:43,750 --> 00:24:44,290
I see, I see.

374
00:24:44,530 --> 00:24:45,150
Um, hold on.

375
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:52,720
Look what I got.

376
00:24:54,660 --> 00:24:54,980
What?

377
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:57,760
That's the royal family signature!

378
00:25:00,460 --> 00:25:01,680
What about the royal music?

379
00:25:04,120 --> 00:25:05,700
I forgot the royal music, though.

380
00:25:11,490 --> 00:25:12,310
Zelda's lullaby.

381
00:25:12,770 --> 00:25:14,190
Okay, left, up, right.

382
00:25:15,310 --> 00:25:15,630
Ah.

383
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:20,440
Oh wait, it's good!

384
00:25:22,060 --> 00:25:23,960
Haha, I thought I did it wrong.

385
00:25:30,330 --> 00:25:33,210
When in doubt about what to do, just play songs.

386
00:25:37,460 --> 00:25:38,640
Oh my god.

387
00:25:43,240 --> 00:25:44,300
She's evil.

388
00:25:45,520 --> 00:25:46,580
Welcome, Link!

389
00:25:46,820 --> 00:25:48,860
I am the great fairy of power.

390
00:25:50,180 --> 00:25:52,700
I'm gonna grant you a sword technique.

391
00:25:54,020 --> 00:25:55,180
Receive it now!

392
00:26:00,040 --> 00:26:00,780
Uh.

393
00:26:02,120 --> 00:26:02,860
Okay.

394
00:26:04,440 --> 00:26:06,260
Where are those things coming from?

395
00:26:07,100 --> 00:26:08,380
This is...

396
00:26:08,380 --> 00:26:09,180
unsettling.

397
00:26:16,350 --> 00:26:17,390
That shot is...

398
00:26:17,390 --> 00:26:17,610
is...

399
00:26:17,610 --> 00:26:18,270
is...

400
00:26:18,270 --> 00:26:18,930
messing with me right now.

401
00:26:19,390 --> 00:26:22,050
You mastered the secret sword technique of the spin attack!

402
00:26:23,750 --> 00:26:25,610
I already know about the spin attack.

403
00:26:26,930 --> 00:26:28,510
Hold B to charge your weapon.

404
00:26:28,710 --> 00:26:30,790
Release B to unleash a wave of energy with your spin.

405
00:26:31,370 --> 00:26:32,910
Don't I already know about this?

406
00:26:34,250 --> 00:26:40,250
If you want to release energy without charging your weapon, just rotate once and press B for a very effective quick spin.

407
00:26:42,270 --> 00:26:43,610
Rotate stick once?

408
00:26:45,070 --> 00:26:45,550
Okay.

409
00:26:47,910 --> 00:26:52,210
When you charge power for a spin attack, magic power will be consumed.

410
00:26:52,710 --> 00:26:54,630
Pay attention to your green magic meter.

411
00:26:54,730 --> 00:26:55,310
No, no, you're wrong.

412
00:26:55,430 --> 00:26:56,110
Magic power is blue.

413
00:26:58,010 --> 00:26:58,470
Hey, boy!

414
00:26:59,030 --> 00:27:01,630
You're a messenger of the royal family, aren't you?

415
00:27:03,050 --> 00:27:09,010
Next time you're in their neighborhood, you should drop in on a friend of mine who lives by Hyrule Castle.

416
00:27:10,730 --> 00:27:12,910
She'll surely grant you another new power.

417
00:27:13,310 --> 00:27:14,070
Oh, Zelda?

418
00:27:16,030 --> 00:27:19,670
When battle has made you wary, please come back to see me.

419
00:27:27,030 --> 00:27:27,510
Aha!

420
00:27:28,010 --> 00:27:28,390
I see.

421
00:27:28,650 --> 00:27:30,090
Our battery is high right now.

422
00:27:31,290 --> 00:27:32,490
That's a battery symbol.

423
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:36,540
Hold on a minute.

424
00:27:44,220 --> 00:27:45,840
Do you like Sauria's song?

425
00:27:47,080 --> 00:27:48,260
Want to talk to Sauria?

426
00:27:48,320 --> 00:27:49,660
Let's try and talk to Sauria here.

427
00:27:50,820 --> 00:27:51,300
Link!

428
00:27:51,860 --> 00:27:52,800
This is Sauria.

429
00:27:53,600 --> 00:27:54,260
Come in.

430
00:27:54,440 --> 00:27:54,900
Can you hear me?

431
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:57,800
Are you collecting spiritual stones?

432
00:27:58,340 --> 00:27:59,680
You have one more to find?

433
00:28:00,740 --> 00:28:02,780
You mean the spiritual stone of water, don't you?

434
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:07,040
The great Deku tree, also called the GD...

435
00:28:07,800 --> 00:28:08,280
TGD?

436
00:28:08,740 --> 00:28:09,140
No.

437
00:28:09,600 --> 00:28:10,060
GDT.

438
00:28:10,620 --> 00:28:11,440
Oh, my God.

439
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:16,960
Once told me that King Sauria, ruler of Sauria's domain, has it.

440
00:28:18,560 --> 00:28:20,060
Oh, that's the water stuff.

441
00:28:22,020 --> 00:28:23,160
I don't want to talk to you again.

442
00:28:24,420 --> 00:28:25,560
Thanks for the information.

443
00:28:26,960 --> 00:28:27,660
Thank you.

444
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:38,040
Should I be speaking to you again, or will I regret?

445
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:45,340
Well, it looks like you've grown up a little from the great fairy's power.

446
00:28:46,460 --> 00:28:50,120
But you still don't really look like the hero who will save Hyrule.

447
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:51,740
At least not yet.

448
00:28:53,320 --> 00:28:56,280
If you are going back down the mountain, I can lend you a wing.

449
00:28:57,260 --> 00:28:58,400
Come here and grab my talents.

450
00:28:58,760 --> 00:28:59,580
And hold on tight!

451
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:00,020
Woohoo!

452
00:29:00,680 --> 00:29:02,780
No, no, no, not yet, not yet, not yet, not yet.

453
00:29:02,960 --> 00:29:03,680
Hold on, I'm leaving.

454
00:29:08,020 --> 00:29:09,180
I thought I was gonna die.

455
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:13,520
I don't need to go all the way back down yet.

456
00:29:13,760 --> 00:29:14,800
Sorry, I have things to do.

457
00:29:17,220 --> 00:29:18,500
Oh, my goodness, I'm dying.

458
00:29:20,180 --> 00:29:20,940
I think we're fine.

459
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:25,780
We may be fine here.

460
00:29:29,760 --> 00:29:32,900
There was one more place down here that we could destroy.

461
00:29:34,060 --> 00:29:34,900
I'll show you.

462
00:29:38,080 --> 00:29:38,560
Here!

463
00:29:38,840 --> 00:29:39,400
You see that?

464
00:29:39,860 --> 00:29:40,580
Right here.

465
00:29:43,820 --> 00:29:45,280
Man, we're running low on bombs!

466
00:29:50,310 --> 00:29:50,790
Yeah!

467
00:29:53,030 --> 00:29:53,510
Ooh!

468
00:29:57,220 --> 00:29:58,640
A purple rupee!

469
00:29:58,780 --> 00:29:59,800
That's 50 rupees!

470
00:30:00,680 --> 00:30:02,240
Oh, my goodness, I'm rich.

471
00:30:03,560 --> 00:30:04,860
I'm gonna go buy bombs.

472
00:30:07,780 --> 00:30:09,680
Gonna go spend all my money on bombs.

473
00:30:12,600 --> 00:30:13,880
They are so valuable.

474
00:30:22,320 --> 00:30:22,840
But...

475
00:30:22,840 --> 00:30:23,660
Think...

476
00:30:23,660 --> 00:30:24,520
Ooh, ooh, ooh.

477
00:30:24,740 --> 00:30:26,220
Man, did you see that strategy right there?

478
00:30:27,000 --> 00:30:28,220
No damage taken.

479
00:30:28,800 --> 00:30:29,860
Actually, pro shit.

480
00:30:31,420 --> 00:30:33,260
I'm gonna take...

481
00:30:33,920 --> 00:30:35,000
What do you mean 120?

482
00:30:35,180 --> 00:30:35,740
Okay, okay, okay.

483
00:30:35,920 --> 00:30:36,800
So, prediction time.

484
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:41,740
We're going to be able to expand our rupee pocket at some point and hold more rupees.

485
00:30:41,900 --> 00:30:42,860
That's the only explanation here.

486
00:30:45,220 --> 00:30:46,360
I guess I'll take 10.

487
00:30:46,540 --> 00:30:46,820
No.

488
00:30:47,780 --> 00:30:48,600
I'll take 20.

489
00:30:51,340 --> 00:30:51,780
Thanks.

490
00:30:54,660 --> 00:30:55,100
Alright!

491
00:30:55,460 --> 00:30:56,080
Not bad.

492
00:30:57,200 --> 00:30:57,800
Full-on bombs.

493
00:30:59,100 --> 00:31:00,380
Now we're ready to rock and roll.

494
00:31:05,620 --> 00:31:06,160
Oh, yeah.

495
00:31:06,220 --> 00:31:06,600
Give me HP.

496
00:31:08,860 --> 00:31:10,140
Okay, let me quickly...

497
00:31:10,140 --> 00:31:13,820
I want to go back up the mountain and try to ride the owl.

498
00:31:14,080 --> 00:31:20,700
That sounded wrong, but, you know, let him take me and fly me down to the bottom because I don't know what he means by bottom.

499
00:31:25,020 --> 00:31:25,400
Okay.

500
00:31:25,900 --> 00:31:26,240
Man!

501
00:31:26,620 --> 00:31:31,560
Am I crazy or do these pots give me even more and more money as time goes on?

502
00:31:40,840 --> 00:31:46,700
I'm gonna destroy these because they contain what my heart desires, which is in this particular instance...

503
00:31:46,700 --> 00:31:47,140
hearts!

504
00:31:47,560 --> 00:31:47,920
Yeah!

505
00:31:50,960 --> 00:31:51,700
Look at that.

506
00:31:51,840 --> 00:31:53,320
Why is someone, um...

507
00:31:53,320 --> 00:31:53,880
doing...

508
00:31:54,400 --> 00:31:55,320
when I pick them up?

509
00:31:55,580 --> 00:31:56,060
You hear that?

510
00:31:57,380 --> 00:31:58,240
Someone is whistling.

511
00:32:00,260 --> 00:32:00,860
Someone's mother.

512
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:02,820
Most likely.

513
00:32:04,440 --> 00:32:04,940
Uh, no, no.

514
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:05,840
I didn't mean to interact with that.

515
00:32:05,920 --> 00:32:06,120
Sorry.

516
00:32:08,020 --> 00:32:08,860
Bag up we go.

517
00:32:09,100 --> 00:32:10,680
Good thing we don't have to destroy these rocks again.

518
00:32:11,100 --> 00:32:12,880
This rock, however, is a little mysterious.

519
00:32:13,100 --> 00:32:13,760
I want to destroy that.

520
00:32:18,810 --> 00:32:19,590
Wow, really?

521
00:32:20,110 --> 00:32:20,410
Shit.

522
00:32:20,750 --> 00:32:21,550
Link, link, link, link.

523
00:32:21,690 --> 00:32:21,870
Come on.

524
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:26,280
Jump!

525
00:32:27,780 --> 00:32:28,320
Good man.

526
00:32:29,940 --> 00:32:31,100
I'm gonna take a little bit of that.

527
00:32:31,240 --> 00:32:31,340
Oh!

528
00:32:31,600 --> 00:32:31,860
Oh, wait.

529
00:32:31,860 --> 00:32:32,260
The battery.

530
00:32:32,420 --> 00:32:32,640
Hold on.

531
00:32:32,820 --> 00:32:33,440
How did I do this?

532
00:32:38,270 --> 00:32:38,590
Oh!

533
00:32:41,070 --> 00:32:43,770
Okay, so it is the same attack but it's, like, powered up now.

534
00:32:47,300 --> 00:32:48,480
Now, how do I get more mana?

535
00:32:50,460 --> 00:32:50,780
Shit.

536
00:32:51,840 --> 00:32:53,360
Actually, what if I walk on the side?

537
00:32:55,360 --> 00:32:56,680
Ah, it's tracking me.

538
00:32:56,760 --> 00:32:56,880
Okay.

539
00:32:58,020 --> 00:32:59,300
Let me evasive action this.

540
00:32:59,600 --> 00:33:00,720
Nope, you can't avoid it.

541
00:33:01,880 --> 00:33:03,260
Guaranteed damage every time.

542
00:33:06,260 --> 00:33:09,380
My body requires a golden Skulltula right now.

543
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:11,540
Oh, shit!

544
00:33:12,380 --> 00:33:13,460
Wow, he actually attacked me!

545
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:15,560
What the hell?

546
00:33:17,200 --> 00:33:18,640
I thought I could sneak past you.

547
00:33:18,840 --> 00:33:19,700
You bastard.

548
00:33:23,650 --> 00:33:24,850
Get that shit out of here.

549
00:33:28,800 --> 00:33:29,520
There we go.

550
00:33:29,660 --> 00:33:29,760
Up.

551
00:33:34,800 --> 00:33:35,760
Okay, this way now.

552
00:33:39,320 --> 00:33:39,860
Down.

553
00:33:41,120 --> 00:33:42,320
Ah, full HP.

554
00:33:47,940 --> 00:33:48,480
Good.

555
00:33:54,230 --> 00:33:56,990
The things I do just to experience the owl.

556
00:33:59,110 --> 00:34:02,670
The owl experience better be the best.

557
00:34:05,190 --> 00:34:06,190
Okay, Mr. Owl.

558
00:34:06,370 --> 00:34:07,770
Actually, wait a minute.

559
00:34:10,630 --> 00:34:11,990
Am I supp...

560
00:34:12,570 --> 00:34:14,390
Oh, I know what to do.

561
00:34:15,250 --> 00:34:18,750
We're gonna buy a thing that gives us immunity to fire.

562
00:34:19,470 --> 00:34:20,130
Of course.

563
00:34:20,250 --> 00:34:20,890
And then we go in here.

564
00:34:21,410 --> 00:34:22,230
Let's keep that in mind.

565
00:34:24,050 --> 00:34:25,090
Yes, I'm ready.

566
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:29,560
Let's do it!

567
00:34:33,540 --> 00:34:35,900
I'm gonna enjoy this ride while I drink my chocolate milk.

568
00:34:46,910 --> 00:34:47,990
The scenic route, eh?

569
00:34:49,470 --> 00:34:51,650
Am I being taxed by the mile here or what?

570
