01:19:42,420 --> 01:19:44,400
This place is a death trap.

1417
01:19:50,220 --> 01:19:50,660
Oh!

1418
01:19:50,840 --> 01:19:51,740
No, that was a heart!

1419
01:19:51,920 --> 01:19:52,480
I missed it!

1420
01:19:52,940 --> 01:19:53,440
Yikes.

1421
01:19:56,280 --> 01:19:57,280
Huge mistake.

1422
01:20:02,450 --> 01:20:03,670
Okay, uh, take me.

1423
01:20:06,230 --> 01:20:06,730
Yes!

1424
01:20:06,970 --> 01:20:07,330
Let's go!

1425
01:20:09,090 --> 01:20:09,930
Pick me up!

1426
01:20:10,530 --> 01:20:11,790
Let's go for a ride.

1427
01:20:23,320 --> 01:20:24,180
Death Mountain.

1428
01:20:26,780 --> 01:20:27,720
What a place.

1429
01:20:33,600 --> 01:20:34,040
Kakariko!

1430
01:20:34,300 --> 01:20:35,640
Okay, so we gotta jump down here.

1431
01:20:46,300 --> 01:20:46,740
Yes!

1432
01:20:47,000 --> 01:20:48,140
There we go!

1433
01:20:51,360 --> 01:20:51,800
Hey!

1434
01:20:52,960 --> 01:20:53,880
Not bad, eh?

1435
01:20:55,060 --> 01:20:56,180
Not bad at all.

1436
01:20:56,520 --> 01:20:57,680
Also fills my heart up.

1437
01:20:58,160 --> 01:20:59,840
Wait, did I get a full heart just now?

1438
01:20:59,980 --> 01:21:00,980
Or was it...

1439
01:21:01,980 --> 01:21:03,460
I forgot how many hearts I had before.

1440
01:21:03,460 --> 01:21:04,940
I have so many, I can't even count anymore.

1441
01:21:08,220 --> 01:21:09,780
All right, now that I'm in here.

1442
01:21:11,300 --> 01:21:13,000
Private concert, just for you.

1443
01:21:20,600 --> 01:21:22,200
Wait, no, that's Zelda song.

1444
01:21:25,460 --> 01:21:27,540
I forgot the, uh, the milk song.

1445
01:21:28,560 --> 01:21:29,800
Was it...

1446
01:21:32,240 --> 01:21:32,860
No.

1447
01:21:35,020 --> 01:21:36,260
More like...

1448
01:21:36,260 --> 01:21:37,060
No.

1449
01:21:40,380 --> 01:21:41,200
Is that the one?

1450
01:21:47,350 --> 01:21:48,670
It's the same!

1451
01:21:49,150 --> 01:21:50,470
All right, all right.

1452
01:21:51,130 --> 01:21:51,970
I capitulate.

1453
01:21:57,620 --> 01:21:58,420
Okay, okay.

1454
01:21:58,580 --> 01:22:00,160
Ba-ba-ba-ba-ba-ba-ba.

1455
01:22:02,700 --> 01:22:03,380
I forgot!

1456
01:22:04,820 --> 01:22:05,300
Uh...

1457
01:22:05,300 --> 01:22:06,140
There it is.

1458
01:22:15,500 --> 01:22:15,720
Ah!

1459
01:22:16,240 --> 01:22:16,940
You like that?

1460
01:22:18,020 --> 01:22:19,380
What a nice song.

1461
01:22:19,840 --> 01:22:21,460
Reminds me of the pasture.

1462
01:22:22,560 --> 01:22:24,840
Makes me feel so good, I can produce a lot of milk.

1463
01:22:26,120 --> 01:22:27,480
Oh, it makes you feel that good, huh?

1464
01:22:28,600 --> 01:22:29,900
Um, yeah, I don't...

1465
01:22:29,900 --> 01:22:31,080
I don't have any containers!

1466
01:22:33,040 --> 01:22:36,140
I need jars, I need pots, I need pans, and I need...

1467
01:22:36,140 --> 01:22:37,380
All kinds of things.

1468
01:22:39,580 --> 01:22:41,260
I'm still missing some cuckoos!

1469
01:22:41,360 --> 01:22:42,660
Please round up five more.

1470
01:22:42,940 --> 01:22:44,760
Five cuckoos.

1471
01:22:46,360 --> 01:22:48,100
Okay, let's actually try to find them.

1472
01:22:48,560 --> 01:22:49,660
How hard can it be?

1473
01:22:49,660 --> 01:22:50,380
Oh, wait.

1474
01:22:51,000 --> 01:22:55,060
We can't actually do it yet, because we gotta go to the other side here, and I don't know how to get over there.

1475
01:22:58,380 --> 01:22:58,920
Then again.

1476
01:23:00,460 --> 01:23:01,960
I may see a way to do it now.

1477
01:23:09,920 --> 01:23:10,440
Hold on.

1478
01:23:10,600 --> 01:23:11,640
It's not that simple, is it?

1479
01:23:14,340 --> 01:23:14,680
Up.

1480
01:23:15,020 --> 01:23:15,340
Oh.

1481
01:23:16,500 --> 01:23:19,420
Have you seen Mr. Dampe, who lives in the graveyard up ahead?

1482
01:23:20,620 --> 01:23:23,640
It's 06.55 right now, so he's probably asleep in his hut.

1483
01:23:25,140 --> 01:23:27,340
Why don't you go out onto the field and kill some time?

1484
01:23:30,000 --> 01:23:31,380
Um, not right now.

1485
01:23:32,780 --> 01:23:37,760
I was thinking maybe I could cuckoo my way to this place over here on the left.

1486
01:23:39,060 --> 01:23:40,680
But of course we need a cuckoo for that.

1487
01:23:49,750 --> 01:23:50,810
Oh, there's one too.

1488
01:23:56,330 --> 01:23:58,230
I forgot where the cuckoos are.

1489
01:23:59,310 --> 01:24:00,090
Wait a second.

1490
01:24:02,690 --> 01:24:03,530
Wait a minute.

1491
01:24:03,750 --> 01:24:04,570
Something's going on here.

1492
01:24:06,790 --> 01:24:09,370
This is not the same person that was out here last night.

1493
01:24:09,870 --> 01:24:12,510
The guy out here last night looked like...

1494
01:24:13,230 --> 01:24:14,730
I don't know, like...

1495
01:24:14,730 --> 01:24:15,890
A different guy.

1496
01:24:18,930 --> 01:24:20,370
Yeah, your sons are worthless.

1497
01:24:20,530 --> 01:24:20,890
I get it.

1498
01:24:26,160 --> 01:24:27,080
Give me all this.

1499
01:24:29,920 --> 01:24:32,560
Dude, this village is such a mystery to me.

1500
01:24:44,470 --> 01:24:46,030
Wasn't there a cuckoo up here?

1501
01:24:47,810 --> 01:24:48,410
There you are.

1502
01:24:50,490 --> 01:24:52,650
Okay, can we use this somehow in a smart way?

1503
01:24:57,400 --> 01:24:59,960
I mean, we can go over there and grab that, but...

1504
01:24:59,960 --> 01:25:01,100
I was thinking...

1505
01:25:01,580 --> 01:25:02,660
I don't know what I was thinking.

1506
01:25:09,270 --> 01:25:11,270
So now that we have this...

1507
01:25:11,270 --> 01:25:13,730
Okay, let me try the thing I was thinking of.

1508
01:25:14,730 --> 01:25:16,770
And if that doesn't work, we're gonna try something else.

1509
01:25:25,560 --> 01:25:26,240
Jump up!

1510
01:25:26,660 --> 01:25:27,580
Oh no, I can't jump up.

1511
01:25:27,760 --> 01:25:27,800
Okay.

1512
01:25:28,500 --> 01:25:28,860
Left now.

1513
01:25:29,000 --> 01:25:29,100
Left.

1514
01:25:31,440 --> 01:25:32,460
Yes, dude!

1515
01:25:33,000 --> 01:25:33,900
Who's the man?

1516
01:25:34,400 --> 01:25:35,480
Who's the man?

1517
01:25:37,740 --> 01:25:38,600
I'm the man.

1518
01:25:38,860 --> 01:25:40,540
Granny's potion shop is closed.

1519
01:25:41,760 --> 01:25:42,800
Gone for field study.

1520
01:25:42,940 --> 01:25:43,520
Please come again.

1521
01:25:44,840 --> 01:25:45,140
Okay.

1522
01:25:48,960 --> 01:25:50,380
Oh, finally.

1523
01:25:54,420 --> 01:25:55,160
Climb.

1524
01:25:59,560 --> 01:26:01,400
Let's see this secret place.

1525
01:26:02,120 --> 01:26:02,980
Who's there?

1526
01:26:03,400 --> 01:26:06,380
What a bad kid trying to enter from the rear door.

1527
01:26:08,000 --> 01:26:09,060
Excuse me.

1528
01:26:11,000 --> 01:26:12,820
Such a bad kid.

1529
01:26:14,120 --> 01:26:16,080
I have to tell you some juicy gossip.

1530
01:26:16,840 --> 01:26:17,520
Oh yeah?

1531
01:26:18,280 --> 01:26:20,020
The boss carpenter has a son.

1532
01:26:20,720 --> 01:26:23,200
He's the guy who sits under the tree every night.

1533
01:26:24,540 --> 01:26:26,120
Don't tell the boss I told you that.

1534
01:26:28,380 --> 01:26:29,420
I mean...

1535
01:26:30,320 --> 01:26:30,840
Okay.

1536
01:26:32,340 --> 01:26:34,600
Oh, wait, we have a...

1537
01:26:34,600 --> 01:26:35,900
Oh, there was a hole!

1538
01:26:37,740 --> 01:26:39,420
I thought it was a shadow or something!

1539
01:26:40,200 --> 01:26:40,700
Wait, what?

1540
01:26:42,140 --> 01:26:43,060
Okay, now we're back up.

1541
01:26:43,320 --> 01:26:44,440
Oh, Jesus Christ.

1542
01:26:44,440 --> 01:26:45,280
That scared me.

1543
01:26:47,560 --> 01:26:48,620
I thought first...

1544
01:26:48,620 --> 01:26:50,140
Like, my thought process was...

1545
01:26:50,140 --> 01:26:50,680
Oh, that's a hole.

1546
01:26:50,760 --> 01:26:51,360
No, wait, that's not a hole.

1547
01:26:51,400 --> 01:26:51,900
That's a shadow.

1548
01:26:52,020 --> 01:26:52,900
And then I wanted to walk on...

1549
01:26:52,900 --> 01:26:53,800
Oh, it was a hole!

1550
01:26:54,280 --> 01:26:54,880
So weird.

1551
01:26:56,100 --> 01:26:57,380
Okay, so time matters in here.

1552
01:26:58,320 --> 01:26:58,960
6.55.

1553
01:27:02,210 --> 01:27:02,570
Okay.

1554
01:27:05,680 --> 01:27:06,880
I have a bad feeling about this.

1555
01:27:08,180 --> 01:27:09,020
Oh, hell yeah!

1556
01:27:11,220 --> 01:27:12,100
Give me that money.

1557
01:27:34,160 --> 01:27:34,940
All right.

1558
01:27:37,160 --> 01:27:39,500
That is actually such a nice look.

1559
01:27:43,010 --> 01:27:43,790
Great shot.

1560
01:27:46,980 --> 01:27:47,620
Back up.

1561
01:27:50,960 --> 01:27:53,000
Okay, you, of course, I gotta bring out.

1562
01:27:55,640 --> 01:27:57,000
But can I from here?

1563
01:28:00,460 --> 01:28:01,480
Oh, hell yeah, I can.

1564
01:28:02,360 --> 01:28:02,840
Good.

1565
01:28:05,840 --> 01:28:07,680
Now we can finally climb up here.

1566
01:28:14,600 --> 01:28:15,680
There you are.

1567
01:28:16,880 --> 01:28:18,340
I've been looking for you!

1568
01:28:19,200 --> 01:28:22,580
Now, before we do anything, maybe we can use this to our advantage and fly somewhere.

1569
01:28:22,920 --> 01:28:24,960
Let's not throw it down just yet.

1570
01:28:26,060 --> 01:28:27,360
I'm thinking ahead right now.

1571
01:28:29,760 --> 01:28:31,120
Wait a minute, where's the...

1572
01:28:36,200 --> 01:28:37,600
I refuse to believe it.

1573
01:28:43,600 --> 01:28:44,440
Let me in.

1574
01:28:47,160 --> 01:28:48,640
I saw a way in.

1575
01:28:49,060 --> 01:28:49,540
Unless...

1576
01:28:49,540 --> 01:28:50,400
It's higher up.

1577
01:28:56,660 --> 01:28:57,800
You can't fool me.

1578
01:29:11,970 --> 01:29:12,910
Okay, fine.

1579
01:29:13,370 --> 01:29:14,150
Be that way.

1580
01:29:14,850 --> 01:29:17,330
Now, can I use this cuckoo that I have up here to...

1581
01:29:17,330 --> 01:29:18,870
Maybe get to the blue roof there.

1582
01:29:20,330 --> 01:29:21,070
Let's try it.

1583
01:29:24,700 --> 01:29:25,780
Ah, there's no way, right?

1584
01:29:30,100 --> 01:29:30,860
There's a...

1585
01:29:31,260 --> 01:29:33,800
Oh, I thought there was a cuckoo on the blue roof, but it's actually a man.

1586
01:29:37,020 --> 01:29:37,740
One leg...

1587
01:29:37,740 --> 01:29:38,620
Ah, there's no way.

1588
01:29:38,700 --> 01:29:38,980
No way.

1589
01:29:40,080 --> 01:29:41,160
Okay, let's bring him back.

1590
01:29:43,900 --> 01:29:44,600
Oh, wait a minute.

1591
01:29:44,720 --> 01:29:45,300
This cuckoo...

1592
01:29:45,300 --> 01:29:46,800
Oh, no, they're resetting.

1593
01:29:47,560 --> 01:29:48,300
That ain't good.

1594
01:29:53,180 --> 01:29:54,480
Gotta go take care of that.

1595
01:30:05,450 --> 01:30:05,950
Beautiful.

1596
01:30:12,940 --> 01:30:13,820
There you go.

1597
01:30:17,170 --> 01:30:17,810
Wait, what?

1598
01:30:19,150 --> 01:30:20,010
Oh, there you are.

1599
01:30:21,390 --> 01:30:22,670
You need to come with me.

1600
01:30:23,970 --> 01:30:25,830
So, now we have...

1601
01:30:25,830 --> 01:30:26,710
Uh...

1602
01:30:26,710 --> 01:30:27,790
Three, I think?

1603
01:30:29,010 --> 01:30:29,930
I can count.

1604
01:30:31,630 --> 01:30:32,130
Four.

1605
01:30:32,290 --> 01:30:32,790
Okay, one more.

1606
01:30:33,430 --> 01:30:35,310
The last one should be all the way upstairs.

1607
01:30:36,690 --> 01:30:37,390
This way.

1608
01:30:38,470 --> 01:30:39,630
Because they're all reset.

1609
01:30:50,180 --> 01:30:50,940
Come here.

1610
01:30:53,880 --> 01:30:54,840
There we go.

1611
01:31:02,160 --> 01:31:03,320
And that should do it, right?

1612
01:31:10,970 --> 01:31:11,890
There we go!

1613
01:31:13,750 --> 01:31:15,510
My cuckoos have run away.

1614
01:31:17,210 --> 01:31:17,770
What?

1615
01:31:17,870 --> 01:31:18,310
There's more?

1616
01:31:19,530 --> 01:31:20,570
Okay, hold on.

1617
01:31:22,910 --> 01:31:23,470
Where?

1618
01:31:33,530 --> 01:31:35,170
Wait, I'm actually hearing something.

1619
01:31:35,510 --> 01:31:36,230
Oh, Navi?

1620
01:31:38,130 --> 01:31:41,010
Ah, please don't ever call me again.

1621
01:31:42,410 --> 01:31:44,150
Call me only if you have urgent news.

1622
01:31:59,530 --> 01:32:00,450
Oh, there's one!

1623
01:32:02,810 --> 01:32:04,190
I can't believe I forgot about that.

1624
01:32:11,410 --> 01:32:12,670
I thought she said five.

1625
01:32:16,730 --> 01:32:17,610
There you go.

1626
01:32:21,840 --> 01:32:22,480
Wait, how many?

1627
01:32:22,540 --> 01:32:22,980
What did you say?

1628
01:32:24,060 --> 01:32:25,440
Please help me bring the last one.

1629
01:32:25,580 --> 01:32:26,300
Okay, okay, one more.

1630
01:32:38,720 --> 01:32:39,440
I don't...

1631
01:32:39,440 --> 01:32:39,760
Oh, man.

1632
01:32:39,840 --> 01:32:42,000
I keep thinking this is a cuckoo up there, but it's a man.

1633
01:32:46,660 --> 01:32:47,880
I'm hearing a cuckoo.

1634
01:32:49,700 --> 01:32:50,620
Are you in the well?

1635
01:32:54,430 --> 01:32:55,430
I hear it over here.

1636
01:33:04,580 --> 01:33:05,640
You're not in here, are you?

1637
01:33:14,230 --> 01:33:14,670
Wait!

1638
01:33:16,230 --> 01:33:17,190
Oh, thank God.

1639
01:33:17,290 --> 01:33:20,590
I thought the cuckoos all went back.

1640
01:33:23,150 --> 01:33:24,430
I think it's on top of the tower.

1641
01:33:30,480 --> 01:33:31,900
I can hear it right here.

1642
01:33:39,580 --> 01:33:40,120
Oh, wait.

1643
01:33:40,160 --> 01:33:41,760
It sounds like it's downstairs now.

1644
01:33:50,380 --> 01:33:51,400
I'm so confused.

1645
01:34:08,260 --> 01:34:09,100
Are you in the...

1646
01:34:09,100 --> 01:34:09,780
Are you in the box?

1647
01:34:10,160 --> 01:34:10,560
Oh!

1648
01:34:13,370 --> 01:34:13,770
Oh!

1649
01:34:15,030 --> 01:34:15,570
It's stuck.

1650
01:34:15,750 --> 01:34:17,170
It's clipping through the box!

1651
01:34:17,370 --> 01:34:17,570
No!

1652
01:34:19,050 --> 01:34:20,730
No, don't do this to me, game.

1653
01:34:22,590 --> 01:34:22,990
No!

1654
01:34:29,720 --> 01:34:30,800
How am I gonna get it?

1655
01:34:43,930 --> 01:34:44,710
Destroy the box.

1656
01:34:46,670 --> 01:34:47,250
Oh, wait.

1657
01:34:47,790 --> 01:34:48,190
Uh...

1658
01:34:48,190 --> 01:34:48,850
Let me use a bomb.

1659
01:34:54,060 --> 01:34:55,460
Isn't that gonna kill the cuckoo?

1660
01:34:56,580 --> 01:34:56,980
Hey!

1661
01:34:57,800 --> 01:34:58,280
Okay!

1662
01:34:59,000 --> 01:35:01,140
I thought it was bugging in the box.

1663
01:35:01,640 --> 01:35:02,060
Oh my God, come here.

1664
01:35:04,180 --> 01:35:05,320
There we go!

1665
01:35:05,900 --> 01:35:07,160
That's gotta be the last one.

1666
01:35:07,720 --> 01:35:08,440
For sure.

1667
01:35:14,460 --> 01:35:15,280
In you go.

1668
01:35:17,890 --> 01:35:20,310
Thank you for finding my cuckoos!

1669
01:35:20,510 --> 01:35:23,290
I have allergies, so I get goosebumps when I touch them.

1670
01:35:23,850 --> 01:35:25,610
I, too, like to bump geese.

1671
01:35:26,790 --> 01:35:28,830
For helping me, I will give this to you.

1672
01:35:29,250 --> 01:35:31,690
It's fine glass, and should be useful.

1673
01:35:31,690 --> 01:35:33,010
Please take good care of it.

1674
01:35:33,350 --> 01:35:34,710
Tell me it's what I think it is.

1675
01:35:37,330 --> 01:35:37,730
Yeah!

1676
01:35:41,230 --> 01:35:41,950
Ha-ha!

1677
01:35:42,850 --> 01:35:46,730
After you put something in this bottle, set it to C when you want to use the item inside.

1678
01:35:48,870 --> 01:35:49,630
Hell yeah!

1679
01:35:50,850 --> 01:35:51,810
But wait a second.

1680
01:35:52,030 --> 01:35:53,050
Didn't I already have one of these?

1681
01:35:56,280 --> 01:35:59,240
Oh, I could have drank this, I guess.

1682
01:36:00,380 --> 01:36:00,860
Oh,

1683
01:36:04,690 --> 01:36:05,030
okay.

1684
01:36:05,230 --> 01:36:06,790
I understand the mechanic now, I think.

1685
01:36:07,690 --> 01:36:08,670
It makes sense.

1686
01:36:09,730 --> 01:36:12,110
Now I need time to move, though, so we can get night.

1687
01:36:14,630 --> 01:36:17,550
What about this information about one of them being his son?

1688
01:36:22,230 --> 01:36:25,430
All day long, we're working many construction projects in the village.

1689
01:36:25,810 --> 01:36:27,550
It's gonna take a while before everything is done.

1690
01:36:28,670 --> 01:36:30,430
Our boss works us very hard.

1691
01:36:32,610 --> 01:36:33,910
