Let them hear the melody of the royal family.

2824
02:42:58,400 --> 02:42:58,980
Hoo-hoo-hoo!

2825
02:43:00,600 --> 02:43:02,360
I mean, that is my approach, you know?

2826
02:43:02,500 --> 02:43:02,780
If...

2827
02:43:03,220 --> 02:43:06,380
If I don't know what to do, then I'm just gonna play some songs.

2828
02:43:07,280 --> 02:43:08,280
And everyone's happy.

2829
02:43:12,220 --> 02:43:12,620
Alright.

2830
02:43:12,980 --> 02:43:14,300
Uh, we gotta blow this shit up.

2831
02:43:17,120 --> 02:43:18,060
Boom, boom, boom.

2832
02:43:18,700 --> 02:43:20,180
I want you in my room.

2833
02:43:20,800 --> 02:43:21,200
Boom.

2834
02:43:25,500 --> 02:43:26,180
Splendid.

2835
02:43:28,500 --> 02:43:29,180
Cuckoo!

2836
02:43:32,640 --> 02:43:33,660
Kameo-meo!

2837
02:43:38,880 --> 02:43:39,560
Oh!

2838
02:43:39,820 --> 02:43:40,260
Secret!

2839
02:43:48,580 --> 02:43:49,400
Oh, no.

2840
02:43:51,040 --> 02:43:51,960
I'm sorry!

2841
02:43:52,460 --> 02:43:53,340
I'm sorry!

2842
02:43:54,060 --> 02:43:54,400
Ah!

2843
02:43:54,740 --> 02:43:55,420
No way!

2844
02:43:57,120 --> 02:43:57,800
Uh.

2845
02:44:02,590 --> 02:44:04,570
I'm gone, I'm gone, I'm gone, I'm gone, I'm gone.

2846
02:44:08,100 --> 02:44:08,780
Sorry!

2847
02:44:09,180 --> 02:44:11,280
I didn't mean to kameo-meo all over you.

2848
02:44:14,200 --> 02:44:15,880
I was trying to do it to the rocks!

2849
02:44:20,960 --> 02:44:21,840
Jesus Christ.

2850
02:44:27,780 --> 02:44:29,820
Trying to turn over all the rocks at once.

2851
02:44:31,020 --> 02:44:31,740
You again!

2852
02:44:34,340 --> 02:44:36,840
We just had this conversation, Mr. Owlman.

2853
02:44:38,900 --> 02:44:40,080
You mind shutting up?

2854
02:44:47,300 --> 02:44:47,920
Come on.

2855
02:44:49,020 --> 02:44:49,380
Shoo!

2856
02:44:49,560 --> 02:44:50,200
Get away from here.

2857
02:44:52,420 --> 02:44:54,020
Don't ever let me see your face again.

2858
02:44:55,720 --> 02:44:56,640
Upside or otherwise.

2859
02:45:00,120 --> 02:45:00,560
Okay.

2860
02:45:00,800 --> 02:45:02,640
Let's not do the, uh, kameo-meo again.

2861
02:45:09,120 --> 02:45:10,160
Doing it manually.

2862
02:45:23,270 --> 02:45:24,170
Uh, you know what?

2863
02:45:25,450 --> 02:45:26,650
Can I use you somehow?

2864
02:45:28,530 --> 02:45:29,170
Wait a sec.

2865
02:45:29,410 --> 02:45:29,850
Ooh, who dat?

2866
02:45:34,270 --> 02:45:35,390
Chomp, chomp, chomp.

2867
02:45:35,390 --> 02:45:37,170
How about some magic beans?

2868
02:45:38,030 --> 02:45:39,470
They aren't selling very well.

2869
02:45:40,770 --> 02:45:41,590
How about...

2870
02:45:41,970 --> 02:45:43,210
10 rupees...

2871
02:45:43,210 --> 02:45:44,250
for one piece.

2872
02:45:44,990 --> 02:45:45,350
All right.

2873
02:45:47,310 --> 02:45:49,330
I thought that was a green banana at first.

2874
02:45:49,870 --> 02:45:51,490
You got a magic bean.

2875
02:45:52,930 --> 02:45:53,490
What?

2876
02:45:53,950 --> 02:45:57,230
Find a suitable spot for a garden and plant it?

2877
02:45:57,630 --> 02:45:59,410
Then wait for something fun to happen.

2878
02:46:01,990 --> 02:46:02,810
No way.

2879
02:46:03,790 --> 02:46:06,970
If you want to plant beans, go around and look for soft soil.

2880
02:46:09,880 --> 02:46:11,620
I know exactly what you're talking about.

2881
02:46:12,160 --> 02:46:12,820
I think.

2882
02:46:13,040 --> 02:46:14,080
I've seen this before.

2883
02:46:19,110 --> 02:46:19,550
Yeah.

2884
02:46:19,810 --> 02:46:19,950
Yeah.

2885
02:46:20,370 --> 02:46:20,810
Exactly.

2886
02:46:21,050 --> 02:46:21,610
That's it.

2887
02:46:22,450 --> 02:46:23,170
Right there.

2888
02:46:24,890 --> 02:46:26,530
I was wondering what that was.

2889
02:46:27,590 --> 02:46:29,490
Looked like a slot for some kind of mechanism.

2890
02:46:30,230 --> 02:46:33,450
But apparently it's soft soil, which it doesn't look like at all to me, but okay.

2891
02:46:39,330 --> 02:46:40,150
Oh my god.

2892
02:46:47,250 --> 02:46:48,650
Let me encourage your growth.

2893
02:47:06,150 --> 02:47:10,670
No, I want to encourage growth by making a mental connection to Kakiri Forest.

2894
02:47:11,910 --> 02:47:12,350
Link!

2895
02:47:12,670 --> 02:47:13,550
This is Aria.

2896
02:47:13,850 --> 02:47:14,310
Can you hear me?

2897
02:47:14,850 --> 02:47:16,950
Are you collecting spiritual stones?

2898
02:47:17,250 --> 02:47:18,990
Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes.

2899
02:47:19,390 --> 02:47:20,430
I don't want to hear it again.

2900
02:47:24,090 --> 02:47:25,390
How long do I have to wait here?

2901
02:47:27,430 --> 02:47:28,310
Nom, nom, nom.

2902
02:47:28,310 --> 02:47:30,190
How about some magic beans, huh?

2903
02:47:30,970 --> 02:47:31,330
Ah!

2904
02:47:32,270 --> 02:47:32,890
You know what?

2905
02:47:32,970 --> 02:47:33,730
I'll take another one.

2906
02:47:35,630 --> 02:47:36,690
Just to have, you know?

2907
02:47:38,650 --> 02:47:39,810
I guess I'll come back.

2908
02:47:41,170 --> 02:47:42,550
I'm sure he'll come this way again later.

2909
02:47:43,390 --> 02:47:44,890
Link, you've got to climb up.

2910
02:47:44,990 --> 02:47:45,790
Oh my god, what are you doing?

2911
02:47:47,070 --> 02:47:47,430
No!

2912
02:47:48,910 --> 02:47:51,010
Oh, sh- Okay, I guess we're getting money out of it.

2913
02:47:51,430 --> 02:47:51,790
Somehow.

2914
02:47:53,210 --> 02:47:54,790
I didn't mean for this to happen.

2915
02:47:56,330 --> 02:47:56,690
No.

2916
02:47:58,810 --> 02:48:00,230
This owl better not be here.

2917
02:48:01,090 --> 02:48:03,070
Don't- Don't give me that same spiel now.

2918
02:48:03,770 --> 02:48:04,670
Just don't do it.

2919
02:48:09,250 --> 02:48:10,090
I'm warning you.

2920
02:48:10,650 --> 02:48:11,710
I'm going this way.

2921
02:48:13,470 --> 02:48:14,570
You cannot get me.

2922
02:48:14,690 --> 02:48:14,890
No!

2923
02:48:15,090 --> 02:48:16,230
Oh, he caught me!

2924
02:48:28,660 --> 02:48:30,740
I'm just gonna drink some chocolate milk.

2925
02:48:30,960 --> 02:48:32,520
It's not very cold anymore, but that's fine.

2926
02:48:38,020 --> 02:48:40,680
What about the melody of- Piss off!

2927
02:48:41,920 --> 02:48:42,920
It's quite a banger.

2928
02:48:45,680 --> 02:48:47,500
Wait, he flew off the other direction now.

2929
02:48:48,500 --> 02:48:48,940
Wow!

2930
02:48:49,180 --> 02:48:49,820
So advanced!

2931
02:48:50,620 --> 02:48:52,400
Because I was on the left, he flew to the right!

2932
02:48:53,220 --> 02:48:54,020
Isn't that funny?

2933
02:48:56,380 --> 02:48:58,460
Now, how do I actually- Oh, I know.

2934
02:48:59,440 --> 02:49:00,160
Cuckoo time!

2935
02:49:09,900 --> 02:49:10,420
No!

2936
02:49:11,380 --> 02:49:12,320
Oh, no!

2937
02:49:12,660 --> 02:49:12,960
No!

2938
02:49:13,200 --> 02:49:13,460
No!

2939
02:49:33,080 --> 02:49:35,780
Please, just let me skip through this.

2940
02:49:36,880 --> 02:49:38,480
Fuck you, Mr. Owl.

2941
02:49:39,120 --> 02:49:42,920
I hate- I hate your feathers and your colors!

2942
02:49:42,920 --> 02:49:45,820
It's a horrible fur coat you got there.

2943
02:49:53,570 --> 02:49:54,910
Just stay gone, please.

2944
02:50:01,040 --> 02:50:04,400
How do I actually freaking get across?

2945
02:50:05,820 --> 02:50:09,260
Wait, am I supposed to grow this beanstalk and then climb it?

2946
02:50:09,860 --> 02:50:10,380
Oh,

2947
02:50:15,040 --> 02:50:15,920
is that what's happening?

2948
02:50:17,700 --> 02:50:18,580
30 now?

2949
02:50:21,080 --> 02:50:21,660
Fine.

2950
02:50:22,360 --> 02:50:23,660
I'll take another one.

2951
02:50:27,660 --> 02:50:28,900
How much is it now?

2952
02:50:34,060 --> 02:50:34,420
Okay.

2953
02:50:34,420 --> 02:50:35,480
Fine, take all my money.

2954
02:50:35,580 --> 02:50:35,820
I don't care.

2955
02:50:42,160 --> 02:50:43,920
I'm gonna plant beans all over the place.

2956
02:50:45,500 --> 02:50:47,280
I don't think I can proceed here.

2957
02:50:49,260 --> 02:50:51,780
I think I may have to grow this thing first and then climb it.

2958
02:50:52,000 --> 02:50:53,660
But why would the... Okay, wait, wait, wait.

2959
02:50:56,500 --> 02:50:57,340
There's no way, right?

2960
02:50:59,140 --> 02:51:00,440
Oh, wait, wait, I see!

2961
02:51:02,340 --> 02:51:03,040
Oh, easy!

2962
02:51:06,290 --> 02:51:07,310
Oh, oh my god.

2963
02:51:10,480 --> 02:51:10,960
Navi!

2964
02:51:12,620 --> 02:51:13,100
Octorok!

2965
02:51:13,620 --> 02:51:15,340
Bounce back the rocks, they spit at you.

2966
02:51:16,320 --> 02:51:18,120
I mean, I'm... Okay.

2967
02:51:20,100 --> 02:51:20,820
Oh my god.

2968
02:51:23,220 --> 02:51:25,060
But I don't have that shield for that.

2969
02:51:26,940 --> 02:51:27,960
Unless I time it.

2970
02:51:28,560 --> 02:51:29,820
Oh, I can slice it.

2971
02:51:32,100 --> 02:51:33,240
What if I just bomb you, huh?

2972
02:51:33,680 --> 02:51:34,220
How about that?

2973
02:51:37,370 --> 02:51:38,470
That's another way to do it.

2974
02:51:43,510 --> 02:51:44,210
No, Link!

2975
02:51:44,610 --> 02:51:45,010
No!

2976
02:51:46,210 --> 02:51:47,330
You're supposed to jump!

2977
02:51:47,710 --> 02:51:48,910
Okay, thank god we're here.

2978
02:51:51,090 --> 02:51:53,530
Oh, I thought I was gonna go all the way back.

2979
02:51:55,850 --> 02:51:56,250
Whew.

2980
02:51:56,250 --> 02:51:57,890
Had a mini heart attack just now.

2981
02:52:01,530 --> 02:52:02,410
Oh, that's a heart.

2982
02:52:06,510 --> 02:52:06,910
Ah.

2983
02:52:10,780 --> 02:52:11,580
I see.

2984
02:52:13,200 --> 02:52:13,920
Very smart.

2985
02:52:16,580 --> 02:52:17,940
I will have to murder you.

2986
02:52:26,000 --> 02:52:27,500
I wish you would stop doing that, Link.

2987
02:52:32,420 --> 02:52:33,100
It's over here.

2988
02:52:43,700 --> 02:52:44,960
Wait, can I even make that jump?

2989
02:52:49,010 --> 02:52:50,310
We may need a chicken here.

2990
02:53:00,930 --> 02:53:01,870
You come with me.

2991
02:53:03,270 --> 02:53:04,770
We have adventures to go on.

2992
02:53:05,630 --> 02:53:06,390
You and I.

2993
02:53:13,390 --> 02:53:14,550
No, hold on, Link!

2994
02:53:14,550 --> 02:53:14,970
No!

2995
02:53:17,270 --> 02:53:18,310
Actually, maybe this is fine.

2996
02:53:20,670 --> 02:53:21,430
Hold the phone.

2997
02:53:29,280 --> 02:53:31,500
Some frogs are looking at you from underwater.

2998
02:53:33,960 --> 02:53:34,960
Well, good for them.

2999
02:53:39,740 --> 02:53:40,720
What do you want, frog?

3000
02:53:44,250 --> 02:53:46,010
Let me dive towards you.

3001
02:53:49,940 --> 02:53:51,140
What am I trying to do?

3002
02:53:52,740 --> 02:53:53,720
I'm trying to high-five him.

3003
02:53:55,400 --> 02:53:55,740
Frog!

3004
02:53:56,460 --> 02:53:57,440
Why are you eyeing me?

3005
02:53:57,720 --> 02:53:58,600
Why are you giving me eyeballs?

3006
02:54:02,870 --> 02:54:03,770
Get up, get up, get up.

3007
02:54:04,170 --> 02:54:04,370
Fight!

3008
02:54:09,690 --> 02:54:11,170
What am I even doing here?

3009
02:54:17,810 --> 02:54:19,690
I mean, I can't even jump across here, can I?

3010
02:54:21,490 --> 02:54:21,930
Oh.

3011
02:54:22,790 --> 02:54:23,730
I can walk!

3012
02:54:24,030 --> 02:54:25,550
I thought it was, uh...

3013
02:54:25,550 --> 02:54:26,330
Oh, Navi!

3014
02:54:29,290 --> 02:54:34,490
I thought you had something actually important to give me, in terms of information.

3015
02:54:35,270 --> 02:54:36,050
You didn't.

3016
02:54:37,750 --> 02:54:38,890
What is this right here?

3017
02:55:00,540 --> 02:55:01,820
Frog, what is it you want?

3018
02:55:07,600 --> 02:55:08,920
I've just about had it with you.

3019
02:55:12,450 --> 02:55:13,850
It looks so goofy.

3020
02:55:19,150 --> 02:55:20,110
Look at it!

3021
02:55:24,930 --> 02:55:25,570
Okay.

3022
02:55:27,050 --> 02:55:28,410
I'll come back later.

3023
02:55:36,540 --> 02:55:39,140
Now, can we jump here without...

3024
02:55:39,960 --> 02:55:40,820
messing up?

3025
02:55:41,060 --> 02:55:41,320
Yep.

3026
02:55:41,780 --> 02:55:42,400
Okay, that works.

3027
02:55:50,760 --> 02:55:51,400
Oh.

3028
02:55:51,880 --> 02:55:52,420
You!

3029
02:55:53,460 --> 02:55:54,100
Dang!

3030
02:55:54,440 --> 02:55:55,540
Don't do it like that!

3031
02:55:57,400 --> 02:55:58,860
Oh, Jesus Christ.

3032
02:56:01,220 --> 02:56:02,280
It's not gonna work.

3033
02:56:05,840 --> 02:56:07,580
Wow, you are such a bully!

3034
02:56:12,760 --> 02:56:14,600
Bro, this path is just...

3035
02:56:14,600 --> 02:56:16,540
as long as in Breath of the Wild!

3036
02:56:20,120 --> 02:56:20,920
Good for me, though.

3037
02:56:20,980 --> 02:56:22,660
There's no annoying person going...

3038
02:56:22,660 --> 02:56:23,260
Hey-oh!

3039
02:56:23,680 --> 02:56:24,900
from the water all the time here.

3040
02:56:29,080 --> 02:56:29,800
Oh, there's a...

3041
02:56:29,800 --> 02:56:31,100
there's a boing-boing there.

3042
02:56:32,540 --> 02:56:33,740
Can I get behind the waterfall?

3043
02:56:35,540 --> 02:56:36,660
It's always a secret, right?

3044
02:56:36,800 --> 02:56:37,400
Oh, maybe not.

3045
02:56:39,740 --> 02:56:41,240
Wow, this current is strong.

3046
02:56:43,240 --> 02:56:44,560
Which I guess makes sense.

3047
02:56:59,860 --> 02:57:01,020
Wait a minute!

3048
02:57:01,380 --> 02:57:02,220
Oh-ho-ho!

3049
02:57:02,380 --> 02:57:02,860
I see it!

3050
02:57:03,520 --> 02:57:04,120
But what's this?

3051
02:57:09,700 --> 02:57:11,460
Okay, I'm gonna be able to open this later.

3052
02:57:12,280 --> 02:57:13,240
Oh, there's a heart!

3053
02:57:19,610 --> 02:57:20,090
Aha!

3054
02:57:21,590 --> 02:57:22,530
You shall be mine.

3055
02:57:25,210 --> 02:57:26,410
Can I even make that jump?

3056
02:57:27,990 --> 02:57:28,470
Yeah!

3057
02:57:28,850 --> 02:57:29,810
Oh, my God!

3058
02:57:30,370 --> 02:57:31,810
I don't think I can make that jump?

3059
02:57:35,180 --> 02:57:36,660
That seems impossible.

3060
02:57:44,690 --> 02:57:45,690
Sleepless waterfall.

3061
02:57:46,090 --> 02:57:48,850
The flow of this waterfall serves the king of Hyrule.

3062
02:57:49,270 --> 02:57:51,850
When the king slumbers, so too do these falls.

3063
02:57:53,210 --> 02:57:54,430
You don't say!

3064
02:58:01,640 --> 02:58:02,160
Oh!

3065
02:58:02,400 --> 02:58:02,960
Oh, God.

3066
02:58:03,400 --> 02:58:04,200
I know what to do.

3067
02:58:05,960 --> 02:58:07,160
That seems impossible.

3068
02:58:10,290 --> 02:58:12,030
Uh, we gotta make time move.

3069
02:58:13,190 --> 02:58:13,750
Somehow.

3070
02:58:14,750 --> 02:58:15,830
Is the time moving?

3071
02:58:19,920 --> 02:58:21,000
16.24.

3072
02:58:25,050 --> 02:58:25,870
Okay, it is!

3073
02:58:25,930 --> 02:58:26,130
It is!

3074
02:58:26,230 --> 02:58:26,490
Perfect!

3075
02:58:26,670 --> 02:58:26,830
Perfect!

3076
02:58:36,450 --> 02:58:37,010
Watch.

3077
02:58:56,180 --> 02:58:57,900
Any moment now.

3078
02:59:00,620 --> 02:59:02,620
Unless I can just jump straight through.

3079
02:59:03,860 --> 02:59:05,080
Can I really?

3080
02:59:08,290 --> 02:59:09,170
Damn!

3081
02:59:14,060 --> 02:59:14,700
Oh, God!

3082
02:59:20,910 --> 02:59:22,010
I will take that.

3083
02:59:24,570 --> 02:59:25,390
Very good.

3084
02:59:28,860 --> 02:59:30,600
Why is the waterfall still going?

3085
02:59:33,040 --> 02:59:35,720
Isn't the king slumbering now, or what?

3086
02:59:52,120 --> 02:59:52,660
Yes!

3087
02:59:52,700 --> 02:59:53,600
There it is!

3088
02:59:56,240 --> 02:59:58,180
We had to put him to sleep with the melody.

3089
03:00:02,010 --> 03:00:02,730
Ha-ha!

3090
03:00:08,100 --> 03:00:09,020
Sora's domain.

3091
03:00:13,600 --> 03:00:15,200
Dude, look at the caustics!

3092
03:00:15,820 --> 03:00:17,100
In this old game?

3093
03:00:17,860 --> 03:00:20,720
I mean, it's not real, of course, but it's kinda cool!

3094
03:00:21,920 --> 03:00:22,780
Love the...

3095
03:00:22,780 --> 03:00:22,880
Oh.

3096
03:00:23,420 --> 03:00:24,500
What are you?

3097
03:00:24,900 --> 03:00:25,780
Vampire creature.

3098
03:00:26,860 --> 03:00:27,960
Oh, God.

3099
03:00:30,440 --> 03:00:33,560
Looks like someone got a costume at Toys R Us or something.

3100
03:00:34,000 --> 03:00:34,920
It's that bad.

3101
03:00:37,740 --> 03:00:38,340
Sora's domain.

3102
03:00:38,560 --> 03:00:39,320
Okay, I...

3103
03:00:39,320 --> 03:00:39,860
Sure.

3104
03:00:41,600 --> 03:00:42,100
Ha!

3105
03:00:43,320 --> 03:00:44,240
What's up?

3106
03:00:45,820 --> 03:00:46,600
Who...

3107
03:00:46,600 --> 03:00:47,640
are you?

3108
03:00:48,680 --> 03:00:50,500
We are the Sora's.

3109
03:00:50,760 --> 03:00:52,700
The proud aquatic people.

3110
03:00:54,040 --> 03:00:59,100
So, you say you have some connection with Hyrule's royal family.

3111
03:00:59,700 --> 03:01:01,380
Well, what do we want from us?

3112
03:01:03,500 --> 03:01:04,540
I want...

3113
03:01:05,080 --> 03:01:06,580
Actually, what do I want from you?

3114
03:01:07,460 --> 03:01:09,180
I want your cojones.

3115
03:01:09,480 --> 03:01:09,980
Your stone.

3116
03:01:10,080 --> 03:01:10,900
You have a stone here.

3117
03:01:11,540 --> 03:01:12,700
I came for it.

3118
03:01:13,260 --> 03:01:14,340
We're good at diving.

3119
03:01:14,780 --> 03:01:15,680
How about you?

3120
03:01:16,740 --> 03:01:22,360
If you want to be a master diver, try the diving game at the top of the waterfall.

3121
03:01:23,000 --> 03:01:24,260
Have you tried it already?

3122
03:01:25,100 --> 03:01:27,120
No, I've not tried your diving game.

3123
03:01:27,300 --> 03:01:27,920
Where's the stone?

3124
03:01:29,700 --> 03:01:30,860
We are good at the...

3125
03:01:30,860 --> 03:01:31,480
I heard you!

3126
03:01:33,460 --> 03:01:33,940
Oh!

3127
03:01:34,720 --> 03:01:35,200
Hello!

3128
03:01:37,020 --> 03:01:38,380
Having a bath, are we?

3129
03:01:40,480 --> 03:01:45,420
We haven't found Princess Ruto, even though some of us have searched as far as Lake Hylia.

3130
03:01:48,100 --> 03:01:48,560
Ruto!

3131
03:01:52,610 --> 03:01:53,310
She's gone!

3132
03:01:55,650 --> 03:01:56,110
Okay.

3133
03:01:56,950 --> 03:01:59,070
Is it my job to find Princess Ruto?

3134
03:02:00,950 --> 03:02:02,030
Whoever she may be?

3135
03:02:03,570 --> 03:02:04,770
I'm going to climb up here again.

3136
03:02:10,960 --> 03:02:11,160
Ah!

3137
03:02:11,380 --> 03:02:12,020
No, no, no, no.

3138
03:02:12,100 --> 03:02:12,780
I need to roll.

3139
03:02:15,180 --> 03:02:16,340
Love the caustics!

3140
03:02:16,840 --> 03:02:17,960
Caustics make me happy.

3141
03:02:22,140 --> 03:02:23,340
All kinds of goodies here.

3142
03:02:24,460 --> 03:02:25,800
Oh, I need those so bad.

3143
03:02:29,010 --> 03:02:29,790
Sora shop!

3144
03:02:29,970 --> 03:02:31,010
We have fresh fish.

3145
03:02:32,350 --> 03:02:33,410
I bet you do.

3146
03:02:41,460 --> 03:02:41,920
Hey!

3147
03:02:44,520 --> 03:02:47,420
I want to buy a fish, but they're a little too expensive.

3148
03:02:48,740 --> 03:02:53,040
I have no choice but to catch one of the fishes that's swimming around out there.

3149
03:02:58,200 --> 03:03:04,260
Can I actually do that too?

3150
03:03:05,740 --> 03:03:06,260
Welcome!

3151
03:03:07,760 --> 03:03:09,300
Uh, talk to the owner.

3152
03:03:10,740 --> 03:03:14,680
If you want to buy fish, you need a container to put them in.

3153
03:03:16,180 --> 03:03:19,060
Um, I'll just take it in my hand, thanks.

3154
03:03:20,600 --> 03:03:22,000
Do you actually sell fish?

3155
03:03:23,080 --> 03:03:23,820
You do!

3156
03:03:24,700 --> 03:03:25,680
200 rupees?

3157
03:03:26,760 --> 03:03:28,620
Just caught and so fresh!

3158
03:03:29,580 --> 03:03:30,900
We can keep it in a bottle.

3159
03:03:31,960 --> 03:03:32,220
Hmm.

3160
03:03:35,860 --> 03:03:37,320
Oh, dude, I want to get a bow!

3161
03:03:37,820 --> 03:03:38,840
Can I get a bow?

3162
03:03:40,580 --> 03:03:41,820
Holy shit, I want a bow.

3163
03:03:42,440 --> 03:03:43,440
A Sora tunic!

3164
03:03:44,180 --> 03:03:46,600
A tunic made by Soras, adult size.

3165
03:03:47,120 --> 03:03:48,600
Prevents you from drowning underwater.

3166
03:03:49,180 --> 03:03:50,060
So, wait a minute!

3167
03:03:51,920 --> 03:03:53,500
Am I an adult or what?

3168
03:03:53,500 --> 03:03:54,980
How old am I?

3169
03:03:59,790 --> 03:04:01,050
You can't get this now.

3170
03:04:01,890 --> 03:04:04,670
Is that because I don't have enough money or because I'm not an adult?

3171
03:04:04,790 --> 03:04:05,770
I'm so confused here.

3172
03:04:06,690 --> 03:04:07,710
What do you mean adult size?

3173
03:04:11,600 --> 03:04:14,740
I mean, I get I'm small, okay, but I was born this way!

3174
03:04:17,000 --> 03:04:17,440
Fine.

3175
03:04:19,320 --> 03:04:22,480
They don't smell to- They don't- They don't sell to little people.

3176
03:04:23,380 --> 03:04:23,640
Hey!

3177
03:04:25,620 --> 03:04:27,720
Sora's fountain is the source of the river.

3178
03:04:28,560 --> 03:04:30,380
Lord Jabu-Jabu lives in the fountain.

3179
03:04:31,040 --> 03:04:31,600
Oh, yeah?

3180
03:04:31,860 --> 03:04:32,280
Who is that?

3181
03:04:32,340 --> 03:04:34,660
Lord Jabu-Jabu is the patron deity of the Soras.

3182
03:04:35,360 --> 03:04:37,620
Princess Rudo is in charge of preparing his meals.

3183
03:04:38,040 --> 03:04:39,380
Morning and night.

3184
03:04:40,520 --> 03:04:41,040
Okay.

3185
03:04:44,140 --> 03:04:44,940
Got it.

3186
03:04:48,860 --> 03:04:50,320
Can I catch these fish?

3187
03:04:52,640 --> 03:04:53,880
Like fish in a barrel.

3188
03:04:55,580 --> 03:04:56,200
Oh!

3189
03:04:56,560 --> 03:04:56,920
Right.

3190
03:04:57,500 --> 03:04:58,200
Of course.

3191
03:05:02,430 --> 03:05:04,910
I think we've got to light these sconces here.

3192
03:05:09,290 --> 03:05:11,930
There's nothing in these rocks, huh?

3193
03:05:15,000 --> 03:05:16,100
Oh, there's a little bit.

3194
03:05:18,940 --> 03:05:19,980
Okay, now...

3195
03:05:22,420 --> 03:05:23,600
I guess we go this way.

3196
03:05:25,020 --> 03:05:26,140
So hidden here.

3197
03:05:27,640 --> 03:05:28,160
Huh?

3198
03:05:31,370 --> 03:05:31,890
Oh!

3199
03:05:40,730 --> 03:05:41,250
Yeah!

3200
03:05:46,590 --> 03:05:47,530
Oh, we're not done.

3201
03:05:47,950 --> 03:05:49,330
We've got to light everything, I guess.

3202
03:05:53,880 --> 03:05:54,680
Do it again!

3203
03:05:54,800 --> 03:05:55,440
Yeah!

3204
03:05:55,900 --> 03:05:56,380
Bwah!

3205
03:05:58,640 --> 03:05:59,160
Sweetness!

3206
03:06:00,740 --> 03:06:01,260
More!

3207
03:06:04,750 --> 03:06:06,410
Actually, now that I have fire there...

3208
03:06:08,110 --> 03:06:09,570
Let me be a little efficient here.

3209
03:06:24,050 --> 03:06:24,570
Nice!

3210
03:06:25,610 --> 03:06:27,650
Now we take from here...

3211
03:06:27,650 --> 03:06:29,210
I think there was more up here.

3212
03:06:33,570 --> 03:06:33,870
Shit.

3213
03:06:34,350 --> 03:06:34,610
No!

3214
03:06:35,070 --> 03:06:35,870
Wrong button.

3215
03:06:37,090 --> 03:06:37,850
Anyway, what's this?

3216
03:06:42,510 --> 03:06:43,190
Oh, okay.

3217
03:06:51,860 --> 03:06:52,580
Just ahead.

3218
03:06:52,800 --> 03:06:53,760
King Sora's chamber.

3219
03:06:54,300 --> 03:06:55,440
Show the proper respect.

3220
03:06:56,200 --> 03:06:56,860
Don't worry.

3221
03:06:57,360 --> 03:06:58,940
I know the customs in this place.

3222
03:07:00,840 --> 03:07:01,900
Wait, this one is not...

3223
03:07:04,560 --> 03:07:05,000
What?

3224
03:07:05,380 --> 03:07:06,500
They stopped being lit?

3225
03:07:11,540 --> 03:07:12,300
Oh, okay.

3226
03:07:12,420 --> 03:07:14,100
I think I need to light them all at the same time.

3227
03:07:15,000 --> 03:07:16,700
Or in quick succession here.

3228
03:07:17,000 --> 03:07:19,500
But let me just check that there aren't more...

3229
03:07:19,500 --> 03:07:21,160
Up here, somewhere.

3230
03:07:25,130 --> 03:07:26,310
There is one here!

3231
03:07:33,140 --> 03:07:34,200
Let's go up here first.

3232
03:07:43,380 --> 03:07:44,060
What.

3233
03:07:44,060 --> 03:07:44,700
The.

3234
03:07:44,900 --> 03:07:45,240
Hell.

3235
03:07:46,760 --> 03:07:48,280
King Sora's throne room.

3236
03:07:48,640 --> 03:07:50,780
To hear the king's royal proclamations.

3237
03:07:50,980 --> 03:07:53,380
Stand on the platform and speak to him.

3238
03:07:54,540 --> 03:07:56,580
I can't wait to hear his pro...

3239
03:07:56,580 --> 03:07:57,680
Proclamations.

3240
03:08:00,260 --> 03:08:00,940
Excu...

3241
03:08:00,940 --> 03:08:01,540
Oh my god.

3242
03:08:01,540 --> 03:08:03,500
You are quite the specimen.

3243
03:08:08,910 --> 03:08:11,890
Oh my dear, sweet princess Rudo.

3244
03:08:12,450 --> 03:08:13,830
Where has she gone?

3245
03:08:14,690 --> 03:08:16,090
I'm so worried.

3246
03:08:18,830 --> 03:08:19,810
I know, right?

3247
03:08:21,550 --> 03:08:23,190
Okay, so she's actually missing.

3248
03:08:23,290 --> 03:08:24,590
And everyone is in pain because of it.

3249
03:08:25,930 --> 03:08:27,650
There's also fire here we can use.

3250
03:08:29,270 --> 03:08:30,610
High dive practice spot.

3251
03:08:30,950 --> 03:08:32,610
Are you confident in your driving skill?

3252
03:08:32,970 --> 03:08:33,710
Diving skill.

3253
03:08:34,470 --> 03:08:34,730
Um.

3254
03:08:35,250 --> 03:08:36,130
Not yet.

3255
03:08:36,130 --> 03:08:36,690
I'm not.

3256
03:08:38,170 --> 03:08:38,930
Boing boing.

3257
03:08:41,350 --> 03:08:42,730
Man, it's the middle of the night.

3258
03:08:46,530 --> 03:08:49,610
I'm surprised they allow me to walk around here next to the king.

3259
03:08:53,590 --> 03:08:54,290
You know what?

3260
03:08:54,470 --> 03:08:55,370
Let me play a melody.

3261
03:08:55,750 --> 03:08:56,030
No!

3262
03:08:58,470 --> 03:08:59,310
I didn't mean to!

3263
03:09:01,010 --> 03:09:02,110
I'm so sorry.

3264
03:09:03,610 --> 03:09:04,490
My god.

3265
03:09:10,780 --> 03:09:11,660
Yeah, you like that?

3266
03:09:19,170 --> 03:09:20,250
No reaction, huh?

3267
03:09:25,020 --> 03:09:26,240
Let me try this instead.

3268
03:09:37,400 --> 03:09:38,240
Not impressed?

3269
03:09:39,100 --> 03:09:41,380
Well, what about this?

3270
03:09:43,980 --> 03:09:45,500
Look at what I got here!

3271
03:09:47,000 --> 03:09:47,520
No?

3272
03:09:47,760 --> 03:09:51,580
Man, nobody appreciates the fact that I have Zelda's signature.

3273
03:09:52,280 --> 03:09:53,760
Oh, let me go grab that fire.

3274
03:09:54,720 --> 03:09:56,220
I think we've got to do this quick now.

3275
03:10:06,400 --> 03:10:06,840
Nice!

3276
03:10:09,620 --> 03:10:10,060
Whoops.

3277
03:10:10,980 --> 03:10:11,580
Go again.

3278
03:10:20,700 --> 03:10:21,880
It's going to go out, isn't it?

3279
03:10:24,750 --> 03:10:25,190
No?

3280
03:10:28,050 --> 03:10:28,490
Wow!

3281
03:10:29,590 --> 03:10:30,770
I guess it gets refreshed.

3282
03:10:38,550 --> 03:10:41,990
It's a piece

3283
03:10:50,620 --> 03:10:51,000
of a heart.

3284
03:10:51,160 --> 03:10:51,340
Nice.

3285
03:10:51,860 --> 03:10:52,380
Good stuff.

3286
03:10:53,120 --> 03:10:54,380
And I have six of them now.

3287
03:10:55,560 --> 03:10:56,280
That's seven!

3288
03:10:57,800 --> 03:10:58,880
Oh, hell yeah!

3289
03:11:01,500 --> 03:11:02,020
Good.

3290
03:11:02,120 --> 03:11:02,980
Good stuff.

3291
03:11:04,960 --> 03:11:05,480
Okay.

3292
03:11:06,180 --> 03:11:07,740
Something I'm a little confused about.

3293
03:11:08,320 --> 03:11:09,000
Check this out.

3294
03:11:09,600 --> 03:11:11,360
You see how there's all this stuff here?

3295
03:11:12,360 --> 03:11:13,720
There's all kinds of things.

3296
03:11:14,220 --> 03:11:16,400
And there's all these melodies that I haven't found.

3297
03:11:16,960 --> 03:11:17,880
And yet...

3298
03:11:19,160 --> 03:11:21,920
It feels like I've been to every corner of the world, you know?

3299
03:11:22,000 --> 03:11:22,960
I've been to the mountain.

3300
03:11:22,960 --> 03:11:24,760
I've been in the domain.

3301
03:11:25,360 --> 03:11:27,460
I've been Kokiri Forest and the castle.

3302
03:11:29,520 --> 03:11:30,620
So, what the hell?

3303
03:11:30,940 --> 03:11:31,440
You know?

3304
03:11:32,600 --> 03:11:33,780
But I guess I'll find out.

3305
03:11:39,120 --> 03:11:40,280
What am I supposed to do now?

3306
03:11:41,460 --> 03:11:43,940
So, it seems the princess is missing.

3307
03:11:46,820 --> 03:11:47,740
We've got to find her.

3308
03:11:49,740 --> 03:11:52,040
Maybe she was abducted by that evil green man.

3309
03:11:56,910 --> 03:11:57,230
Oh!

3310
03:11:57,530 --> 03:11:58,550
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

3311
03:11:58,630 --> 03:11:59,350
Let me actually go up there.

3312
03:12:00,590 --> 03:12:01,370
There is a way.

3313
03:12:02,130 --> 03:12:02,450
Whoops.

3314
03:12:05,490 --> 03:12:07,610
Let's try the competition thing.

3315
03:12:09,770 --> 03:12:13,890
Maybe if I can prove to them that I'm a great diver, they will allow me to...

3316
03:12:14,610 --> 03:12:15,410
Wait, what am I doing?

3317
03:12:16,630 --> 03:12:17,490
I'm going the wrong way.

3318
03:12:18,230 --> 03:12:21,990
Then they will allow me to do things that no other person is allowed to do.

3319
03:12:22,150 --> 03:12:23,750
Because I'm a special fairy boy.

3320
03:12:24,590 --> 03:12:26,490
And I have special fairy privileges.

3321
03:12:36,630 --> 03:12:39,890
Look how respectful Link is walking like this here.

3322
03:12:40,110 --> 03:12:40,610
Quietly.

3323
03:12:49,060 --> 03:12:50,280
Oh, hello there.

3324
03:12:52,440 --> 03:12:53,300
Diving game.

3325
03:12:53,460 --> 03:12:54,020
20 rupees.

3326
03:12:54,800 --> 03:12:55,200
Want to play?

3327
03:12:56,180 --> 03:12:57,640
Ooh, that's all my money.

3328
03:12:58,600 --> 03:12:59,200
Yeah.

3329
03:12:59,960 --> 03:13:00,420
Okay!

3330
03:13:01,820 --> 03:13:03,940
Pick up all the rupees I throw from here.

3331
03:13:04,220 --> 03:13:05,880
You have only a limited amount of time.

3332
03:13:07,740 --> 03:13:10,340
When you pick them all up, come back here.

3333
03:13:10,520 --> 03:13:11,960
I'll give you something very nice.

3334
03:13:13,160 --> 03:13:14,580
Why does this sound like a scam?

3335
03:13:20,400 --> 03:13:20,780
Start!

3336
03:13:21,180 --> 03:13:21,500
Okay.

3337
03:13:22,500 --> 03:13:22,960
Whoa!

3338
03:13:24,100 --> 03:13:24,900
Not bad.

3339
03:13:28,060 --> 03:13:28,580
Dive!

3340
03:13:31,940 --> 03:13:32,460
Link!

3341
03:13:34,060 --> 03:13:34,500
Okay.

3342
03:13:40,340 --> 03:13:40,880
Come on.

3343
03:13:42,780 --> 03:13:44,060
It's the easiest game of my life.

3344
03:13:47,890 --> 03:13:48,330
Easy!

3345
03:13:50,090 --> 03:13:51,910
Y'all think you can hang with me?

3346
03:13:52,130 --> 03:13:52,710
Think again.

3347
03:13:54,070 --> 03:13:54,430
Hey!

3348
03:13:54,770 --> 03:13:55,210
Congratulations!

3349
03:13:55,410 --> 03:13:56,950
I've got something very nice for you.

3350
03:13:57,050 --> 03:13:57,470
Come and get it.

3351
03:13:59,130 --> 03:14:00,910
Wow, these guys are bored as hell, huh?

3352
03:14:01,570 --> 03:14:02,390
Oh, who are you?

3353
03:14:04,070 --> 03:14:05,970
Have you seen Lord Jabu Jabu?

3354
03:14:07,330 --> 03:14:08,330
I haven't.

3355
03:14:09,110 --> 03:14:09,710
Oh!

3356
03:14:09,930 --> 03:14:10,870
That's not good.

3357
03:14:11,930 --> 03:14:16,170
Everybody who comes around here should see Lord Jabu Jabu at least once.

3358
03:14:17,670 --> 03:14:19,870
Sora's Fountain is just beyond King Sora's Throne.

3359
03:14:20,470 --> 03:14:22,810
That is where Lord Jabu Jabu swims.

3360
03:14:22,950 --> 03:14:23,250
But!

3361
03:14:24,190 --> 03:14:28,470
Unless you have King Sora's permission, you can't go to Sora's Fountain.

3362
03:14:30,550 --> 03:14:31,610
Well, that sucks.

3363
03:14:32,230 --> 03:14:32,910
Oh, wait a minute.

3364
03:14:32,990 --> 03:14:33,670
There's a door down here.

3365
03:14:34,210 --> 03:14:36,790
Okay, I'm gonna learn to dive really deep here somehow.

3366
03:14:37,910 --> 03:14:39,130
That's the ability I'm gonna get.

3367
03:14:41,070 --> 03:14:42,090
I have seen him!

3368
03:14:43,410 --> 03:14:49,770
According to the legend of Sora, the act of offering a fish to Lord Jabu Jabu will make you happy.

3369
03:14:50,650 --> 03:14:51,210
Ha ha ha!

3370
03:14:51,490 --> 03:14:53,090
Wait, it will make me happy or him?

3371
03:14:55,390 --> 03:14:56,690
Sounds like he will be happy.

3372
03:14:56,770 --> 03:14:58,170
Sounds like I will be out of a fish.

3373
03:14:59,930 --> 03:15:02,150
That is quite expensive, I might add.

3374
03:15:05,300 --> 03:15:06,620
Sounds like a scam to me.

3375
03:15:06,680 --> 03:15:09,500
Are you in cohorts with Lord Jabu Jabu?

3376
03:15:12,560 --> 03:15:13,760
Let me go back up here.

3377
03:15:16,320 --> 03:15:20,240
Where on earth could this princess be?

3378
03:15:26,120 --> 03:15:26,840
Yeah, I...

3379
03:15:27,480 --> 03:15:29,360
Yeah, that's very pretty, Link.

3380
03:15:30,580 --> 03:15:31,540
But put it away now.

3381
03:15:39,460 --> 03:15:41,380
Sir, will you, um...

3382
03:15:43,060 --> 03:15:45,160
Oh, my dear, sweet princess Roto.

3383
03:15:45,800 --> 03:15:46,760
Where has she gone?

3384
03:15:48,560 --> 03:15:48,920
Um...

3385
03:15:48,920 --> 03:15:50,460
Navi, where are you when I need you?

3386
03:15:50,760 --> 03:15:52,140
I need you right now, Navi.

3387
03:15:54,280 --> 03:15:56,280
So, apparently, I still have to go here.

3388
03:15:58,540 --> 03:16:00,860
I'm just not understanding what to do, I guess.

3389
03:16:02,480 --> 03:16:05,800
We could try and play a special melody for this king.

3390
03:16:11,040 --> 03:16:12,800
What other melodies do we possess?

3391
03:16:19,380 --> 03:16:19,900
Sansong...

3392
03:16:19,900 --> 03:16:22,200
Sarias, Eponas...

3393
03:16:22,200 --> 03:16:22,760
Zeldas.

3394
03:16:23,580 --> 03:16:25,100
Let me try and target you first.

3395
03:16:25,880 --> 03:16:26,400
There.

3396
03:16:38,260 --> 03:16:39,440
No reaction, eh?

3397
03:16:41,660 --> 03:16:42,100
Uh...

3398
03:16:42,100 --> 03:16:43,020
What about...

3399
03:16:52,760 --> 03:16:53,200
Moo!

3400
03:17:03,210 --> 03:17:03,650
What?

3401
03:17:07,760 --> 03:17:09,580
I don't understand what's happening...

3402
03:17:09,580 --> 03:17:10,080
Here.

3403
03:17:11,500 --> 03:17:12,620
What was that just now?

3404
03:17:25,440 --> 03:17:26,260
Speak to me.

3405
03:17:27,180 --> 03:17:28,760
I do want to talk to Sauria.

3406
03:17:30,080 --> 03:17:31,580
Uh, you got something new for me?

3407
03:17:34,620 --> 03:17:35,680
Uh, yeah.

3408
03:17:35,800 --> 03:17:37,920
King Sora, ruler of Sora's domain, has it.

3409
03:17:38,020 --> 03:17:38,180
Yes.

3410
03:17:40,580 --> 03:17:41,180
Once more.

3411
03:17:42,280 --> 03:17:43,740
Oh my god, I actually skipped.

3412
03:17:44,840 --> 03:17:46,620
Are you collecting spiritual stones?

3413
03:17:46,780 --> 03:17:48,020
You have one more to find.

3414
03:17:49,900 --> 03:17:50,900
Spiritual stone of water.

3415
03:17:51,000 --> 03:17:51,300
Yeah, yeah.

3416
03:17:53,880 --> 03:17:54,680
Okay, uh...

3417
03:17:54,680 --> 03:17:56,100
Well, this guy is not going to give it to me.

3418
03:17:56,700 --> 03:17:58,200
Because he is, uh...

3419
03:17:58,200 --> 03:17:59,280
Unhappy about...

3420
03:17:59,280 --> 03:18:00,740
The princess being missing.

3421
03:18:01,860 --> 03:18:02,900
Let me try the sun song.

3422
03:18:12,850 --> 03:18:13,250
Yeah?

3423
03:18:27,620 --> 03:18:29,500
He did not appreciate that song.

3424
03:18:29,960 --> 03:18:31,520
I got thrown out of the club.

3425
03:18:34,060 --> 03:18:34,620
Unbelievable.

3426
03:18:38,040 --> 03:18:39,640
Well, alright, um...

3427
03:18:40,880 --> 03:18:42,660
Let me go up to the shop again.

3428
03:18:50,010 --> 03:18:50,690
Oh, no, no.

3429
03:18:51,090 --> 03:18:52,030
Let me see what you have.

3430
03:18:53,590 --> 03:18:54,250
A fish.

3431
03:18:54,390 --> 03:18:55,250
200 rupees.

3432
03:18:55,530 --> 03:18:57,050
I can actually afford it if I...

3433
03:18:57,050 --> 03:18:58,290
Get more money.

3434
03:18:58,490 --> 03:18:59,650
I can't afford it now.

3435
03:19:01,350 --> 03:19:02,210
Oh, this one!

3436
03:19:02,210 --> 03:19:04,010
That's gonna allow me to dive deep.

3437
03:19:05,790 --> 03:19:06,230
300.

3438
03:19:06,710 --> 03:19:07,150
So...

3439
03:19:07,150 --> 03:19:10,210
We gotta kill Skulltulas to expand our...

3440
03:19:11,910 --> 03:19:12,770
Allowance, I guess.

3441
03:19:13,970 --> 03:19:14,610
Recovery heart?

3442
03:19:14,750 --> 03:19:15,350
That's not worth it.

3443
03:19:16,790 --> 03:19:18,150
Good to know you can get it here, though.

3444
03:19:24,250 --> 03:19:25,110
Nope, don't...

3445
03:19:25,110 --> 03:19:25,790
Don't look at that.

3446
03:19:27,010 --> 03:19:28,370
So let me look at the map here.

3447
03:19:29,150 --> 03:19:31,330
We've gone up to the place up there.

3448
03:19:32,170 --> 03:19:33,730
There's something underneath the water.

3449
03:19:34,990 --> 03:19:36,790
That requires 300 gold.

3450
03:19:37,970 --> 03:19:38,410
I...

3451
03:19:38,410 --> 03:19:38,670
I...

3452
03:19:38,670 --> 03:19:40,950
I don't think I can do anything else in here right now.

3453
03:19:44,410 --> 03:19:44,850
Yeah.

3454
03:19:46,630 --> 03:19:48,350
I may have to go get more money.

3455
03:19:50,930 --> 03:19:52,310
Also, this one should be doable.

3456
03:19:52,470 --> 03:19:52,710
Come on.

3457
03:19:55,270 --> 03:19:56,810
I just refuse to believe it.

3458
03:19:58,290 --> 03:19:58,730
Yeah!

3459
03:19:59,150 --> 03:19:59,750
Oh, wow.

3460
03:20:00,430 --> 03:20:01,930
Okay, not from that angle, that's for sure.

3461
03:20:12,210 --> 03:20:12,830
Up here.

3462
03:20:17,380 --> 03:20:18,600
Okay, I think I know how to do this.

3463
03:20:19,260 --> 03:20:19,500
Nope!

3464
03:20:23,940 --> 03:20:24,520
Oh, no, not here.

3465
03:20:24,620 --> 03:20:24,800
Not here.

3466
03:20:25,060 --> 03:20:25,680
Down one.

3467
03:20:30,700 --> 03:20:31,260
Come on!

3468
03:20:31,560 --> 03:20:33,180
Oh, that was so close.

3469
03:20:34,360 --> 03:20:34,800
Shit.

3470
03:20:38,670 --> 03:20:40,190
Okay, maybe I can't get it yet.

3471
03:20:42,450 --> 03:20:43,350
Let me back in.

3472
03:20:48,680 --> 03:20:49,320
Open up.

3473
03:20:52,090 --> 03:20:53,450
I must have missed something in here.

3474
03:21:04,690 --> 03:21:05,910
What a crazy place.

3475
03:21:10,030 --> 03:21:11,410
Okay, let me see here.

3476
03:21:17,100 --> 03:21:18,900
So up there is where the king is.

3477
03:21:19,640 --> 03:21:20,420
Oh, wait a minute.

3478
03:21:21,100 --> 03:21:22,580
I haven't actually talked to that guy.

3479
03:21:24,100 --> 03:21:25,160
After we did the thing.

3480
03:21:25,380 --> 03:21:26,300
The diving thing.

3481
03:21:29,130 --> 03:21:31,190
He promised us something very nice.

3482
03:21:33,150 --> 03:21:36,410
If it's not very nice, I will report him to the authorities, by the way.

3483
03:21:36,890 --> 03:21:38,470
Because he's running a scam then.

3484
03:21:39,730 --> 03:21:42,610
First, he gets me to jump off a dangerously high cliff.

3485
03:21:43,870 --> 03:21:46,510
And then he promises me great treasures.

3486
03:21:48,330 --> 03:21:49,150
Diving game!

3487
03:21:50,350 --> 03:21:50,630
Wanna...

3488
03:21:51,350 --> 03:21:52,550
Did we do this already?

3489
03:21:53,490 --> 03:21:54,050
Okay!

3490
03:21:55,270 --> 03:21:56,310
I guess I...

3491
03:21:56,310 --> 03:21:57,310
I shouldn't have left.

3492
03:21:58,590 --> 03:21:59,450
God damn it.

3493
03:21:59,830 --> 03:22:00,670
Okay, we're gonna try again.

3494
03:22:03,470 --> 03:22:06,250
This guy's way too excited about me playing his diving game.

3495
03:22:15,000 --> 03:22:16,180
Okay, not bad.

3496
03:22:23,250 --> 03:22:23,930
Down.

3497
03:22:25,050 --> 03:22:26,850
This game is too easy.

3498
03:22:30,920 --> 03:22:31,960
Oh, yeah!

3499
03:22:35,200 --> 03:22:38,700
You're gonna give me two nice things now, I think.

3500
03:22:40,660 --> 03:22:41,900
That's what you owe me.

3501
03:22:43,620 --> 03:22:44,900
After that performance.

3502
03:23:06,300 --> 03:23:08,180
I saw you spawn in!

3503
03:23:08,380 --> 03:23:09,660
I saw you!

3504
03:23:10,660 --> 03:23:12,500
You were not at your post there for a moment.

3505
03:23:13,880 --> 03:23:14,940
I see everything.

3506
03:23:17,860 --> 03:23:19,540
What a graceful dive!

3507
03:23:20,240 --> 03:23:21,180
Now please take this.

3508
03:23:22,120 --> 03:23:24,560
This is a scale of our kind.

3509
03:23:25,300 --> 03:23:27,960
With this, you can dive much deeper under the water.

3510
03:23:28,380 --> 03:23:29,020
Oh, hell yeah!

3511
03:23:31,220 --> 03:23:32,580
You got the silver scale!

3512
03:23:33,060 --> 03:23:34,780
Jump into the water and press A.

3513
03:23:35,060 --> 03:23:36,620
You can dive deeper than you could before.

3514
03:23:38,580 --> 03:23:39,060
Alright!

3515
03:23:39,820 --> 03:23:40,680
I know what to do.

3516
03:23:43,080 --> 03:23:43,760
There it is!

3517
03:23:43,940 --> 03:23:44,740
Let's see if we can make it, though.

3518
03:23:44,860 --> 03:23:46,480
We still have a little time only.

3519
03:23:47,300 --> 03:23:47,920
To breathe.

3520
03:23:49,440 --> 03:23:49,980
Oh god.

3521
03:23:52,580 --> 03:23:53,180
Wait a sec.

3522
03:23:56,760 --> 03:23:57,720
Let's not do this again.

3523
03:24:00,080 --> 03:24:02,740
I thought maybe you would comment on me having a scale.

3524
03:24:11,840 --> 03:24:13,440
Lake Hylia!

3525
03:24:17,310 --> 03:24:18,850
Oh my god.

3526
03:24:23,800 --> 03:24:24,600
Really?

3527
03:24:28,000 --> 03:24:28,620
Oh, hey!

3528
03:24:30,920 --> 03:24:31,720
Speak!

3529
03:24:34,040 --> 03:24:35,740
I am a Sora.

3530
03:24:36,420 --> 03:24:38,600
Have you seen anything strange in the lake?

3531
03:24:38,900 --> 03:24:41,520
The river carries many things into this lake.

3532
03:24:42,780 --> 03:24:44,320
Yeah, I've heard that, actually.

3533
03:24:44,640 --> 03:24:46,160
You're not the first one to mention this.

3534
03:24:48,360 --> 03:24:49,380
I am a...

3535
03:24:49,380 --> 03:24:49,920
I'll see you later.

3536
03:24:52,380 --> 03:24:54,120
I saw something below me just now.

3537
03:24:54,700 --> 03:24:55,660
Oh, it's money.

3538
03:25:01,960 --> 03:25:03,780
Oh, that's a breathing apparatus!

3539
03:25:04,880 --> 03:25:05,880
Made of kelp!

3540
03:25:07,720 --> 03:25:09,580
We will establish a beachhead!

3541
03:25:12,380 --> 03:25:14,820
And we will aggressively hunt you and your family!

3542
03:25:16,780 --> 03:25:17,660
Wait, what is that?

3543
03:25:20,180 --> 03:25:21,540
You got an empty bottle.

3544
03:25:22,200 --> 03:25:24,240
Put something inside and press E to use it.

3545
03:25:24,240 --> 03:25:24,820
What?!

3546
03:25:25,440 --> 03:25:26,940
Something's already inside?

3547
03:25:29,260 --> 03:25:30,300
It's a hot dog!

3548
03:25:34,820 --> 03:25:35,340
Letter.

3549
03:25:36,800 --> 03:25:38,060
Oh my goodness!

3550
03:25:39,060 --> 03:25:40,120
Let's go test it.

3551
03:25:43,340 --> 03:25:44,580
Oh, we got a phone call.

3552
03:25:45,380 --> 03:25:46,740
I wonder if...

3553
03:25:46,740 --> 03:25:47,200
Oh my god.

3554
03:25:47,540 --> 03:25:51,660
Say those words one more time and I will stuff you in this bottle and never let you leave.

3555
03:25:53,580 --> 03:25:54,700
Let me sniff this.

3556
03:25:56,000 --> 03:25:57,040
Yeah, it's old.

3557
03:25:57,530 --> 03:25:57,900
Huh?

3558
03:25:58,860 --> 03:26:02,160
It looks like there is something already inside this bottle.

3559
03:26:02,540 --> 03:26:03,740
It's a letter.

3560
03:26:05,460 --> 03:26:06,440
Help me!

3561
03:26:06,780 --> 03:26:09,680
I'm waiting for you inside Lord Jabu-Jabu's belly.

3562
03:26:10,360 --> 03:26:10,700
Rude.

3563
03:26:11,520 --> 03:26:11,890
What?!

3564
03:26:15,320 --> 03:26:16,300
P.S.

3565
03:26:16,820 --> 03:26:17,720
Don't tell my father.

3566
03:26:18,500 --> 03:26:22,760
Jabu-Jabu has eaten the princess!

3567
03:26:24,720 --> 03:26:31,060
We're gonna have to slice open his belly and we're gonna have princess roll out of there.

3568
03:26:32,040 --> 03:26:38,200
Covered in guts and I will be covered in glory and praise because I will have saved the princess.

3569
03:26:38,360 --> 03:26:38,660
Who are you?

3570
03:26:40,240 --> 03:26:41,320
My name is Pierre.

3571
03:26:41,700 --> 03:26:43,000
The wandering scarecrow.

3572
03:26:43,160 --> 03:26:46,240
Actually, I wish I could wander to look for soul-moving sounds.

3573
03:26:46,920 --> 03:26:48,400
But I'm kind of stuck here.

3574
03:26:51,790 --> 03:26:52,370
Uh-huh.

3575
03:26:55,970 --> 03:26:57,210
You're not wandering anywhere.

3576
03:26:58,210 --> 03:26:59,130
What are you on about?

3577
03:27:02,860 --> 03:27:03,580
What about you?

3578
03:27:03,660 --> 03:27:04,120
What's your name?

3579
03:27:04,900 --> 03:27:05,560
Let me guess.

3580
03:27:05,640 --> 03:27:05,940
Julius?

3581
03:27:07,500 --> 03:27:08,880
I am Bonoru.

3582
03:27:09,180 --> 03:27:12,500
I couldn't be more or farther from the truth here.

3583
03:27:13,140 --> 03:27:14,740
The scarecrow musical genius.

3584
03:27:15,140 --> 03:27:17,680
I hear a song once and I never forget it, baby.

3585
03:27:18,320 --> 03:27:19,260
Is that so?

3586
03:27:22,320 --> 03:27:23,560
Let me give you a heart one.

3587
03:27:26,860 --> 03:27:27,320
Whoa!

3588
03:27:27,600 --> 03:27:28,940
You have an ocarina!

3589
03:27:29,500 --> 03:27:31,720
Hey, why don't you lay a tune on me with it, baby?

3590
03:27:32,520 --> 03:27:33,700
That's what I was gonna do.

3591
03:27:40,020 --> 03:27:40,760
Oh, well.

3592
03:27:40,760 --> 03:27:43,100
I don't remember that song, baby.

3593
03:27:43,840 --> 03:27:44,140
Why?

3594
03:27:44,880 --> 03:27:46,180
That's what I can't tell ya!

3595
03:27:46,620 --> 03:27:47,460
Good golly!

3596
03:27:48,560 --> 03:27:49,060
Huh?

3597
03:27:52,200 --> 03:27:52,720
What?

3598
03:28:01,930 --> 03:28:02,450
So...

3599
03:28:02,450 --> 03:28:03,150
Huh?

3600
03:28:13,110 --> 03:28:15,110
I guess you don't remember that well, do you?

3601
03:28:15,890 --> 03:28:16,410
Liar!

3602
03:28:17,690 --> 03:28:19,530
I guess I need a specific song here?

3603
03:28:24,520 --> 03:28:25,820
Let's play the sun song.

3604
03:28:29,290 --> 03:28:31,850
Uh, the sun song goes like...

3605
03:28:36,040 --> 03:28:36,760
Never mind.

3606
03:28:38,320 --> 03:28:39,180
Uh, okay.

3607
03:28:39,420 --> 03:28:41,060
We gotta come back here with a melody, I guess.

3608
03:28:42,060 --> 03:28:43,420
This guy loves the music.

3609
03:28:43,640 --> 03:28:44,560
He loves to dance to it.

3610
03:28:48,500 --> 03:28:49,420
Yeah, save the game.

3611
03:28:51,660 --> 03:28:52,360
There we go.

3612
03:28:54,200 --> 03:28:55,660
And then we're gonna...

3613
03:28:55,660 --> 03:28:56,880
Continue next time!

3614
03:28:59,040 --> 03:28:59,700
That's right.

3615
03:29:00,060 --> 03:29:01,480
We're gonna continue next time.

3616
03:29:04,280 --> 03:29:05,200
Uh, hold on.

3617
03:29:05,240 --> 03:29:05,960
I need to...

3618
03:29:06,900 --> 03:29:10,760
actually be careful with the music here because this could get copyright claimed.

3619
03:29:12,440 --> 03:29:12,920
Uh...

3620
03:29:12,920 --> 03:29:16,180
I need to keep speaking otherwise the music will be, you know...

3621
03:29:16,180 --> 03:29:18,240
la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la...

3622
03:29:18,240 --> 03:29:20,120
La-la-la-la-la-la-la...

3623
03:29:20,120 --> 03:29:20,820
There we go!

3624
03:29:25,070 --> 03:29:26,310
Let's put on something else.

3625
03:29:26,510 --> 03:29:26,850
There we go.

3626
03:29:28,050 --> 03:29:29,550
No more copyright bullshit.

3627
03:29:34,970 --> 03:29:35,450
Uh...

3628
03:29:35,450 --> 03:29:36,350
I saved the game perfect.

3629
03:29:37,190 --> 03:29:37,870
Very good.

3630
03:29:40,850 --> 03:29:42,090
Alright guys, what's up?

3631
03:29:44,290 --> 03:29:45,930
I intentionally didn't take a break.

3632
03:29:46,030 --> 03:29:46,390
You know why?

3633
03:29:47,910 --> 03:29:49,130
Because I didn't want to!

3634
03:29:49,410 --> 03:29:51,410
I just wanted to play the game!

3635
03:29:52,230 --> 03:29:53,810
I got a little absorbed.

3636
03:29:58,280 --> 03:29:59,900
It is pretty addicting.

3637
03:30:01,500 --> 03:30:04,860
Like, the atmosphere is just fantastic.

3638
03:30:05,100 --> 03:30:06,100
I really, really love it.

3639
03:30:07,700 --> 03:30:08,640
Great atmosphere.

3640
03:30:14,030 --> 03:30:19,130
Man, I can only imagine what I would have felt if I played this as a young kid, you know?

3641
03:30:20,370 --> 03:30:20,730
Man.

3642
03:30:22,390 --> 03:30:24,270
I can see why people think it's special.

3643
03:30:24,470 --> 03:30:26,310
And I'm not even done with it yet, you know?

3644
03:30:31,680 --> 03:30:32,040
Graveyard.

3645
03:30:32,200 --> 03:30:33,200
More like Raveyard.

3646
03:30:33,620 --> 03:30:34,640
Oh, that's good!

3647
03:30:35,240 --> 03:30:36,020
That's a good one.

3648
03:30:36,100 --> 03:30:37,160
What the hell was that all about?

3649
03:30:37,260 --> 03:30:37,920
Wasn't that crazy?

3650
03:30:42,470 --> 03:30:44,470
Oliver, people were asking if you were colorblind.

3651
03:30:44,950 --> 03:30:45,630
Colorblind, are you?

3652
03:30:45,710 --> 03:30:46,330
No, I'm just blind.

3653
03:30:47,370 --> 03:30:49,710
Color falls within that category, apparently.

