3918
03:45:24,010 --> 03:45:24,730
Crimes, exactly!

3919
03:45:25,510 --> 03:45:26,650
I didn't even think about that.

3920
03:45:26,750 --> 03:45:26,930
But yeah.

3921
03:45:27,550 --> 03:45:28,390
You could say that.

3922
03:45:32,600 --> 03:45:34,420
That's what I love about, for example, this game.

3923
03:45:35,280 --> 03:45:36,000
Is that...

3924
